Transire Eletrônicos\",\"companyLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/transireoficial/\",\"companyId\":\"11696946\",\"companyUniversalName\":\"transireoficial\",\"companyLogo\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQEQ_cpVu4XlTw/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1738328478827/transireoficial_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=aqu-7KnKbGQ5YHptW4PnF1BucmNNVbthwAal5YiR4Ik\",\"sizes\":[{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQEQ_cpVu4XlTw/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1738328478827/transireoficial_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=aqu-7KnKbGQ5YHptW4PnF1BucmNNVbthwAal5YiR4Ik\",\"width\":400,\"height\":400},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQEQ_cpVu4XlTw/company-logo_200_200/company-logo_200_200/0/1738328478826/transireoficial_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=_G_tzOf5zfluj9YnjhcrM-xAlzeyO3FeR9G34Fs_bwo\",\"width\":200,\"height\":200},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQEQ_cpVu4XlTw/company-logo_100_100/company-logo_100_100/0/1738328478827/transireoficial_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=g-s-cxG34UNA5YotExeYNhKtLhY6CK01gn6SNK6m5o0\",\"width\":100,\"height\":100}]},\"location\":\"Manaus e Região, Brasil\",\"dateRange\":null,\"duration\":\"2 yrs 1 mo\",\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"Oct\",\"year\":2018,\"text\":\"Oct 2018\"},\"endDate\":{\"month\":\"Oct\",\"year\":2020,\"text\":\"Oct 2020\"},\"description\":\"General Manager for Materials and Logistics. Managing all companies from Transire Grup in Brazil. \\nWarehousing and Shipping distributions.\\nGerente Geral de Logística e Materiais.\",\"skills\":[\"Gestão de projetos\",\"Gestão de segurança\",\"Gestão\"],\"employmentType\":\"Full-time\",\"workplaceType\":\"\"},{\"position\":\"Material & Procurement (PCM) Manager\",\"companyName\":\"LG Electronics\",\"companyLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/lg-electronics/\",\"companyId\":\"3503\",\"companyUniversalName\":\"lg-electronics\",\"companyLogo\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D560BAQGN7rHQ0dPpPw/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1694507080864/lg_electronics_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=WAASihpDh51sfNYrWeZ6o5IfIIrzBwTWe5p4HSiGdyk\",\"sizes\":[{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D560BAQGN7rHQ0dPpPw/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1694507080864/lg_electronics_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=WAASihpDh51sfNYrWeZ6o5IfIIrzBwTWe5p4HSiGdyk\",\"width\":400,\"height\":400},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D560BAQGN7rHQ0dPpPw/company-logo_200_200/company-logo_200_200/0/1694507080864/lg_electronics_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=l-wI79oJII-pyA4Pd9Z08Ra2xLCHVkBMAKBmOK569Mg\",\"width\":200,\"height\":200},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D560BAQGN7rHQ0dPpPw/company-logo_100_100/company-logo_100_100/0/1694507080864/lg_electronics_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=j5IThXqlOC-QL9j18067OR5gSy5ppkDYZuJwsGLFiU4\",\"width\":100,\"height\":100}]},\"location\":\"Manaus e Região, Brasil\",\"dateRange\":null,\"duration\":\"3 yrs\",\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"Nov\",\"year\":2015,\"text\":\"Nov 2015\"},\"endDate\":{\"month\":\"Oct\",\"year\":2018,\"text\":\"Oct 2018\"},\"description\":\"Leading Material Supply Operation and Material Procurement (PMC) for 3 divisions (ARCON, MWO & SMT) from Local & Overseas. Including Receiving, Line feeding and Warehousing Management.\\nSetting up yearly planning, Budgeting, Maintaining the raw material cost ratio at the optimum profitable level with main and sub-KPIs (LTI, DIO, Airfreight, etc.)\\nRecently elected by the LG core as the highest KPI achievement in 2017 (compared to 2016)\\nAlso been reference in LG Manaus for Material Automation for low cost operation as Man Power, Espace and Lead Time reduction. That was related to AGVs (Automated Guided Vehicle) and Smart Elevators implementation. Aldo worked as Quality Manager Deputy for about 2 years.\",\"skills\":[\"Gestão de projetos\",\"Gestão\"],\"employmentType\":\"\",\"workplaceType\":\"\"},{\"position\":\"General Site Manager (3PL)\",\"companyName\":\"Menlo Worldwide Logistics\",\"companyLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/xpologistics/\",\"companyId\":\"2430668\",\"companyUniversalName\":\"xpologistics\",\"companyLogo\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4E0BAQGGDyzUyKCIwQ/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1668436097032/xpologistics_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=nZ3nt0H6ABZgzlp99BRBmqtocamm9nj69u7MA60rvi0\",\"sizes\":[{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4E0BAQGGDyzUyKCIwQ/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1668436097032/xpologistics_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=nZ3nt0H6ABZgzlp99BRBmqtocamm9nj69u7MA60rvi0\",\"width\":400,\"height\":400},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4E0BAQGGDyzUyKCIwQ/company-logo_200_200/company-logo_200_200/0/1668436097032/xpologistics_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=kzXADbZljhdpqbqoq-qW-rKt6V-uuZmafhvlJlTYnls\",\"width\":200,\"height\":200},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4E0BAQGGDyzUyKCIwQ/company-logo_100_100/company-logo_100_100/0/1668436097032/xpologistics_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=kcTKoPOFoI_oSrGdKwin627J8LDlifFaaiBZpjnBrI0\",\"width\":100,\"height\":100}]},\"location\":\"Manaus Area, Brazil\",\"dateRange\":null,\"duration\":\"3 yrs 1 mo\",\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"Oct\",\"year\":2012,\"text\":\"Oct 2012\"},\"endDate\":{\"month\":\"Oct\",\"year\":2015,\"text\":\"Oct 2015\"},\"description\":\"Responsible for leading (and Branch Managing) two operations (Manaus and São Paulo) Storage of raw material for clients within the operational, commercial and administrative level .\\nIn Manaus, designed and executed from the beginning (scratch), the whole project receiving, storage and distribution of materials for our customers. Today being the legal representative of the company in Brazil \\nEssential Functions:\\n- Startup Operations\\n- Defines requirements for multiple operations and ensures the implementation of new strategies and initiatives to effectively meet or exceed Company requirements & customer expectations\\n- Ensures daily distribution and light manufacturing activities are executed and accountable for performance shortfalls – develop corrective action plans when performance falls below target\\n- Responsible for exceeding customer metrics (cost, quality, and responsiveness) KPI’s, QBR’s, etc.\\n- Implement and coach Lean Warehousing System \\n- Inbound & Outbound expertise\\n- Regularly reviews performance expectations with leadership team. Providing expectations, performance planning, feedback, Training & Development and performance discussions. \\n- Provide support for Sales region quotations and expansion of business scope and service offerings\\n- Identify new business growth opportunities with new or current customers\\n- Develop and implement a healthy and safe work environment\\n- Supervises and develops staff and otherwise carries out supervisory responsibilities in accordance with the organization’s policies and applicable laws\\n- Manages quality system and continuous process improvement within the facility\\n- Supports account receivable follow up process\\n- Review and approve operations expenses\\n- Develop and achieve Budget and Operating Income Goals.\",\"skills\":[\"Sistemas de gestão de segurança\",\"Gestão de projetos\",\"Gestão de segurança\",\"Liderança organizacional\",\"Gestão\"],\"employmentType\":\"\",\"workplaceType\":\"\"},{\"position\":\"Sourcing Purchasing Manager\",\"companyName\":\"Nokia\",\"companyLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/nokia/\",\"companyId\":\"1070\",\"companyUniversalName\":\"nokia\",\"companyLogo\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E0BAQE_ff-lEcAC5w/company-logo_400_400/B4EZqby_U_HgAY-/0/1763550426950/nokia_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=C7NwY1hSuJBshkb2JKrbUEX-Ju2JRlr4bmdduNammxo\",\"sizes\":[{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E0BAQE_ff-lEcAC5w/company-logo_400_400/B4EZqby_U_HgAY-/0/1763550426950/nokia_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=C7NwY1hSuJBsh