00/B4DZoSU4HEGQAY-/0/1761244054464/pucrs_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=ksgajr-w8RkLjnxRBxY_uuJcZZZfkclqRpbwfjVQvXQ\"}},{\"title\":\"FGV - Fundação Getulio Vargas\",\"subtitle\":null,\"link\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/school/8175/\",\"caption\":\"3,029,907 followers\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4D0BAQFtDwxOTmj18Q/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1657633907178/fgv_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=24K--BFc-ubMeSxUyX8VNarehfmtt5p2K7EmeVTu36E\"}}]}],\"openProfile\":false,\"_meta\":{\"pagination\":{\"totalElements\":46,\"totalPages\":2,\"pageNumber\":1,\"previousElements\":0,\"pageSize\":25}},\"profileIdInSearch\":\"ACwAAA6j1OQBYR9JgflIYwdGNtL182kQGbZmCj0\"}},{\"profile_url\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/icaroguimaraes\",\"full_name\":\"Ícaro Guimarães\",\"first_name\":\"Ícaro\",\"last_name\":\"Guimarães\",\"public_identifier\":\"icaroguimaraes\",\"linkedin_id\":\"ACoAAAfBrFIBUV0LXcr4raoYOtYU5avMfZ53sOE\",\"job_title\":\"Business Intelligence Lead | Data & AI | Microsoft Fabric | Analytics Engineering | Executive Dashboards | Product Thinking\",\"headline\":\"Business Intelligence Lead | Data & AI | Microsoft Fabric | Analytics Engineering | Executive Dashboards | Product Thinking\",\"company_name\":\"Ícaro Guimarães Business Intelligence\",\"location\":\"Manaus, Amazonas, Brazil\",\"industry\":null,\"photo_url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4E03AQHC8itNIWZRtQ/profile-displayphoto-shrink_800_800/profile-displayphoto-shrink_800_800/0/1566011750084?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=5c0vvg9hmRMHU_m2syllipBnF41bo74IFjyWQU1olXY\",\"cover_photo_url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4E16AQFy9yiK8pqqYA/profile-displaybackgroundimage-shrink_350_1400/profile-displaybackgroundimage-shrink_350_1400/0/1620088986578?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=4HiI_SIibhfjC92JcrkiSB4nDQsc4HFbQKnqab1KXlg\",\"about\":\"Profissional de Business Intelligence com mais de 13 anos de experiência, especializado em Microsoft Power BI e soluções analíticas para tomada de decisão executiva. Formado em Ciência de Dados pela Universidade do Estado do Amazonas. Atuo na interseção entre tecnologia e negócio, construindo inteligência de dados que realmente é usada pela liderança. Aberto a novas oportunidades em CLT remoto, híbrido ou consultoria.\\n\\nI\'m a Business Intelligence professional with 13+ years of experience transforming raw data into decisions that actually move businesses forward.\\n\\nMy career has been built at the intersection of technology and business understanding — a combination that most BI analysts don\'t have. I don\'t just build dashboards; I understand the financial, operational, and strategic context behind the numbers, which means the solutions I deliver are used by executives, not just stored in a folder.\\n\\nOne of my most significant projects was leading the consolidation of a full BI environment at one of the largest gas distribution companies in Brazil — building dashboards for P&L, cash flow, budget forecasting, and investment tracking, all integrated with ERP systems and consumed at the C-level on a daily basis.\\n\\nCore expertise:\\n→ Microsoft Power BI (DAX, Power Query, Data Modeling, Power BI Service & Embedded)\\n→ Financial & operational dashboards for executive decision-making\\n→ ETL pipelines, SQL, and ERP integration\\n→ BI team leadership and data culture development\\n→ MBA in Data Science (UEA, 2026), adding statistical modeling and machine learning to BI solutions\\n\\nI\'m also the founder of Data Wises, a BI consultancy where I\'ve delivered projects for 10+ clients and trained 300+ professionals in Power BI — from fundamentals to advanced DAX, Power Query, and data modeling.\\n\\nI don\'t limit myself to a single stack. When Power BI alone isn\'t enough to solve a problem, I build the solution — from browser-based ETL tools that consolidate millions in budget data without any server infrastructure, to full-stack systems (PHP/MySQL) that support lead generation and CRM processes. The common thread isn\'t the technology — it\'s finding the fastest, most reliable path from raw data to a decision someone can act on.\\n\\nOpen to new full-time, remote, or consulting opportunities in BI, Analytics, or Data leadership roles — Brazil or international.\",\"skills\":[\"Habilidades analíticas\",\"Planejamento estratégico\",\"Negociação\",\"Gestão\",\"Tomada de decisões\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"Oracle Database\",\"Microsoft SQL Server\",\"Azure\",\"Analytics Engineering\",\"Power BI Administration\",\"Power BI Service\",\"Semantic Models\",\"Data warehouse\",\"Lakehouse\",\"OneLake\",\"Microsoft Fabric\",\"Data Governance\",\"Programação lógica\",\"Aprendizado de máquina\",\"Orange\",\"SQL\",\"Ciência de dados\",\"Ferramentas de business intelligence\",\"Gestão ágil de projetos\",\"Big data\",\"Inteligência de marketing\",\"Aplicativos móveis\",\"Orçamento, planejamento e previsão\",\"Demonstrações financeiras\",\"DAX (Expressões de análise de dados)\",\"Dashboards\",\"Operações de TI\",\"Analítica de dados\",\"Análise de dados\",\"ERP Software\",\"Tecnologia da Informação\",\"Project Planning\",\"Microsoft CRM\",\"Office 365\",\"Windows Azure\",\"Microsoft Excel\",\"Microsoft PowerPoint\",\"Microsoft Power BI\",\"WordPress\",\"Microsoft Windows\",\"Servidor Windows\",\"Microsoft Office\"],\"experience\":[{\"position\":\"CEO | Instrutor de Power BI | Especialista em Business Intelligence\",\"companyName\":\"Ícaro Guimarães Business Intelligence\",\"companyLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/icaroguimaraes/\",\"companyId\":\"105754423\",\"companyUniversalName\":\"icaroguimaraes\",\"companyLogo\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQFB0JGUZWIWBQ/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1734001850232?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=3tK0XvSentnWlhGewDausN2WgjbrzhBfoj1x_n8Am4c\",\"sizes\":[{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQFB0JGUZWIWBQ/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1734001850232?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=3tK0XvSentnWlhGewDausN2WgjbrzhBfoj1x_n8Am4c\",\"width\":400,\"height\":400},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQFB0JGUZWIWBQ/company-logo_200_200/company-logo_200_200/0/1734001850232?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=S383BrEpkuXwb9zDco1Pn_nPlISWsZbdJQuq1K2eDrU\",\"width\":200,\"height\":200},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQFB0JGUZWIWBQ/company-logo_100_100/company-logo_100_100/0/1734001850232?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=gVhTW4d9IRhlDf9oDLG52BNxYnnEbVSJWY_XW91UAIU\",\"width\":100,\"height\":100}]},\"location\":\"Manaus, Amazonas, Brazil\",\"dateRange\":null,\"duration\":\"1 yr 10 mos\",\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"Nov\",\"year\":2024,\"text\":\"Nov 2024\"},\"endDate\":{\"text\":\"Present\"},\"description\":\"Independent BI consultancy focused on helping companies activate their data through Microsoft Power BI and business intelligence solutions.\\n\\n→ Delivered BI consulting projects for 10+ clients across different industries, including sales performance monitoring with active, real-time tracking of client commercial behavior\\n→ Trained 300+ professionals in Microsoft Power BI — covering fundamentals through advanced topics including DAX, Power Query, data modeling, and ETL\\n→ Developed custom dashboards and analytical reports tailored to each client\'s business context, enabling faster and more accurate decision-making\\n→ Conducted both in-person and online training sessions, adapting technical content for non-technical audiences\\n\\nCore services: Power BI consulting · Custom dashboard development · Corporate BI training · Data strategy advisory\",\"skills\":[\"Ferramentas de business intelligence\",\"Microsoft Power BI\",\"Gestão ágil de projetos\"],\"employmentType\":\"Self-employed\",\"workplaceType\":\"On-site\"},{\"position\":\"Supervisor de Inovação e Business Intelligence\",\"companyName\":\"Cigás\",\"companyLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/companhia-de-g%C3%A1s-do-amazonas/\",\"companyId\":\"9250636\",\"companyUniversalName\":\"companhia-de-g%C3%A1s-do-amazonas\",\"companyLogo\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQExKC3Ey3he1g/company-logo_400_400/B4DZp9QnhtH0AY-/0/1763038100128/companhia_de_gs_do_amazonas_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=secLwuTqwuTraCBMsB8Je5Kv4gn4IPxuV2_OKWpQzqA\",\"sizes\":[{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQExKC3Ey3he1g/company-logo_400_400/B4DZp9QnhtH0AY-/0/1763038100128/companhia_de_gs_do_amazonas_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=secLwuTqwuTraCBMsB8Je5Kv4gn4IPxuV2_OKWpQzqA\",\"width\":400,\"height\":400},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQExKC3Ey3he1g/company-logo_200_200/B4DZp9QnhtH0AI-/0/1763038100128/companhia_de_gs_do_amazonas_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=JXHcZH7peQV4e2jROShfmg7IEuotPeE1Ivp3gPIkq-Q\",\"width\":200,\"height\":200},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQExKC3Ey3he1g/company-logo_100_100/B4DZp9QnhtH0AQ-/0/1763038100128/companhia_de_gs_do_amazonas_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=UDUSLN88U2VXWzpds0YOrsBlRXFsoXtmI0U4uysp3ho\",\"width\":100,\"height\":100}]},\"location\":\"Manaus, Amazonas, Brazil\",\"dateRange\":null,\"duration\":\"3 yrs 5 mos\",\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"Mar\",\"year\":2023,\"text\":\"Mar 2023\"},\"endDate\":{\"month\":\"Jul\",\"year\":2026,\"text\":\"Jul 2026\"},\"description\":\"Responsável pela área de Business Intelligence e Inovação em uma das maiores distribuidoras de gás do Brasil, gerenciando um portfólio de mais de 40 projetos e dashboards ativos, consumidos por todas as áreas da organização.\\n\\n→ Desenvolvo e mantenho 40+ dashboards e relatórios no Power BI cobrindo KPIs financeiros, operacionais, comerciais e executivos — utilizados diariamente pela liderança em todos os departamentos\\n→ Automatizei o pipeline completo de relatórios contábeis, tornando todas as informações disponíveis em até 2 horas após o fechamento mensal — eliminando consolidações manuais e reduzindo o tempo de espera da diretoria\\n→ Estruturei e evoluo os modelos de dados corporativos (Data Warehouse e Data Marts), garantindo consistência, escalabilidade e governança de dados na organização\\n→ Atuei como analista de negócios para a plataforma ArcGIS, integrando dados geoespaciais ao ecossistema de BI da companhia para suporte a decisões operacionais e estratégicas\\n→ Liderei iniciativas de transformação digital utilizando Power Platform, Python e integrações sistêmicas, automatizando processos entre áreas\\n→ Defini KPIs e métricas estratégicas em parceria com as áreas de negócio, traduzindo dados operacionais em insumos para decisões executivas\\n→ Gerencio o backlog de demandas de BI, priorizando entregas alinhadas ao planejamento estratégico da companhia\\n→ Promovo a cultura data-driven na organização, disseminando o uso de dados e boas práticas de analytics para times não técnicos\\n\\nStack: Microsoft Power BI · DAX · Power Query · Power Platform · Python · SQL · Data Warehouse · ETL · ArcGIS · Integração com ERP\",\"skills\":[],\"employmentType\":\"Full-time\",\"workplaceType\":\"On-site\"},{\"position\":\"Especialista em Business Intelligence\",\"companyName\":\"Cigás\",\"companyLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/companhia-de-g%C3%A1s-do-amazonas/\",\"companyId\":\"9250636\",\"companyUniversalName\":\"companhia-de-g%C3%A1s-do-amazonas\",\"companyLogo\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQExKC3Ey3he1g/company-logo_400_400/B4DZp9QnhtH0AY-/0/1763038100128/companhia_de_gs_do_amazonas_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=secLwuTqwuTraCBMsB8Je5Kv4gn4IPxuV2_OKWpQzqA\",\"sizes\":[{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQExKC3Ey3he1g/company-logo_400_400/B4DZp9QnhtH0AY-/0/1763038100128/companhia_de_gs_do_amazonas_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=secLwuTqwuTraCBMsB8Je5Kv4gn4IPxuV2_OKWpQzqA\",\"width\":400,\"height\":400},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQExKC3Ey3he1g/company-logo_200_200/B4DZp9QnhtH0AI-/0/1763038100128/companhia_de_gs_do_amazonas_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=JXHcZH7peQV4e2jROShfmg7IE