rgy projects.\\n\\nWe operate in the real estate market, developing and commercializing projects. Our Clients are individuals, companies and investors looking for high returns and safety in business. We provide complex services to investors and residential real estate buyers.\\n\\nWe develop and execute solar photovoltaic projects both residential and commercial.\\n\\n\\nImplementation of companies\\n\\nWe help companies to implement locally and we follow up the operation with management option. We develop projects for raising incentives at levels: Municipal, State and Federal.\\n\\nWe turn your company into a partner for great business in Brazil.\",\"skills\":[],\"employmentType\":\"\",\"workplaceType\":\"\"},{\"position\":\"Real Estate Broker\",\"companyName\":\"AD Dragowski\",\"companyLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/search/results/all/?keywords=AD+Dragowski\",\"companyId\":\"\",\"companyUniversalName\":\"\",\"companyLogo\":null,\"location\":\"Warsaw, Masovian District, Poland\",\"dateRange\":null,\"duration\":\"1 yr 7 mos\",\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"Jun\",\"year\":2009,\"text\":\"Jun 2009\"},\"endDate\":{\"month\":\"Dec\",\"year\":2010,\"text\":\"Dec 2010\"},\"description\":\"Real Estate Training. Assistance in marketing, selling and purchasing property.\",\"skills\":[],\"employmentType\":\"\",\"workplaceType\":\"\"}],\"education\":[{\"schoolName\":\"Universidade Cidade de São Paulo (Unicid)\",\"schoolLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/501625/\",\"schoolId\":\"501625\",\"degree\":\"Master of Business Administration (M.B.A.)\",\"fieldOfStudy\":\"MBA in Development and Management of Real Estate Business\",\"skills\":[],\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"Jan\",\"year\":2011,\"text\":\"Jan 2011\"},\"endDate\":{\"month\":\"Sep\",\"year\":2012,\"text\":\"Sep 2012\"},\"period\":\"Jan 2011 - Sep 2012\",\"schoolLogo\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQGkw0oiHz7VgQ/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1733140903386/unicid_univers