"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E0BAQE5Ii-OkWuvGA/company-logo_100_100/company-logo_100_100/0/1699282749905/sporthochschule_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=0Ibd28kEfW-gVyZw4YUyMBwpKvkKIe9qt2Lb00p-q6k\",\"width\":100,\"height\":100}]}},{\"schoolName\":\"Akademia Wychowania Fizycznego im. Józefa Piłsudskiego w Warszawie\",\"schoolLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/15097330/\",\"schoolId\":\"15097330\",\"degree\":\"Master\'s degree\",\"fieldOfStudy\":\"Rehabilitation Science\",\"skills\":[],\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"Sep\",\"year\":2001,\"text\":\"Sep 2001\"},\"endDate\":{\"month\":\"Jun\",\"year\":2005,\"text\":\"Jun 2005\"},\"period\":\"Sep 2001 - Jun 2005\",\"schoolLogo\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4E0BAQE1VzcGsxJtkQ/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1630639071685/akademia_wychowania_fizycznego_im_jzefa_pisudskiego_w_warszawie_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=VnyIGIcoz4m23pZ6lvuJ9B5yGybOWz9kbQZ12pNOY-4\",\"sizes\":[{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4E0BAQE1VzcGsxJtkQ/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1630639071685/akademia_wychowania_fizycznego_im_jzefa_pisudskiego_w_warszawie_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=VnyIGIcoz4m23pZ6lvuJ9B5yGybOWz9kbQZ12pNOY-4\",\"width\":400,\"height\":400},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4E0BAQE1VzcGsxJtkQ/company-logo_200_200/company-logo_200_200/0/1630639071685/akademia_wychowania_fizycznego_im_jzefa_pisudskiego_w_warszawie_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=4brvxk86ifunPnGaqlGh9MSCnVzNg2t1FXc7ph-9SLg\",\"width\":200,\"height\":200},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4E0BAQE1VzcGsxJtkQ/company-logo_100_100/company-logo_100_100/0/1630639071685/akademia_wychowania_fizycznego_im_jzefa_pisudskiego_w_warszawie_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=uHECz1uePY5XOJwJKrlfgOHmJPHwwVOg1FxSoHfewoA\",\"width\":100,\"height\":100}]}}],\"certifications\":[{\"title\":\"TTI - Certification as a Real Estate Transaction Technician\",\"issuedBy\":\"United Latino Students Association\",\"issuedAt\":null,\"link\":\"http://creci-ce.gov.br/\",\"issuedByLink\":null,\"issuedByLogo\":{\"url\":null,\"sizes\":[]}}],\"languages\":[{\"name\":\"English\",\"proficiency\":\"Full professional proficiency\"},{\"name\":\"German\",\"proficiency\":\"Professional working proficiency\"},{\"name\":\"Polish\",\"proficiency\":\"Native or bilingual proficiency\"},{\"name\":\"Portuguese\",\"proficiency\":\"Professional working proficiency\"},{\"name\":\"Spanish\",\"proficiency\":\"Full professional proficiency\"}],\"projects\":[],\"connections_count\":2452,\"followers_count\":2931,\"open_to_work\":false,\"hiring\":false,\"premium\":false,\"verified\":false,\"phone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"website\":\"\",\"source\":\"harvestapi_full\",\"raw_profile\":{\"id\":\"ACoAAAFV3O0BuuPW2LQHH9ZP9MMZxppZveV4Z7k\",\"publicIdentifier\":\"zbigkozak\",\"linkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/zbigkozak\",\"firstName\":\"Zbigniew S.\",\"lastName\":\"K.\",\"emails\":[],\"headline\":\"Amazonpreneur - CEO SOLALIS - BUILDING LIFE SUSTAINING SYSTEMS\",\"openToWork\":false,\"hiring\":false,\"premium\":false,\"influencer\":false,\"memorialized\":false,\"creator\":true,\"location\":{\"linkedinText\":\"Manaus, Amazonas, Brazil\",\"countryCode\":\"BR\",\"parsed\":{\"text\":\"Manaus, Brazil\",\"countryCode\":\"BR\",\"regionCode\":null,\"country\":\"Brazil\",\"countryFull\":\"Brazil\",\"state\":\"Amazonas\",\"city\":\"Manaus\"}},\"objectUrn\":\"22404333\",\"registeredAt\":\"2008-03-11T03:03:16.000Z\",\"topSkills\":[],\"connectionsCount\":2452,\"followerCount\":2931,\"verified\":false,\"about\":\"Desde 2018 Zbigniew está construindo uma CIDADE CIRCULAR na Amazônia - modelo de desenvolvimento equilibrado e próximo passo na evolução humana.\\n\\nEmpreendedor social contribui com à conservação da Floresta Amazônica - o maior tesouro na Terra, guardiã das culturas milenárias, informações de milhões de anos de evolução e fundamental para a estabilizar o clima global.\\n\\nHISTÓRICO: Zbigniew Kozak nasceu em Varsóvia, Polônia. Formou-se em fisioterapia. Cursou o primeiro módulo do MBA em Gestão e Desenvolvimento de Projetos Imobiliários na Universidade da Cidade de São Paulo. Desde 2010 reside no Brasil e, desde 2016, visita frequentemente comunidades tradicionais na Amazônia. Possui experiência com energia solar fotovoltaica, impressão 3D e construção naval. Interessa-se por ciência e inovação.\\n\\nDesde 2018, desenvolve projetos com impacto socioambiental positivo. Possui experiência em turismo, marketing, vendas para clientes de alto padrão e com investidores.\\n\\nViveu em Dubai, Nova York, na Espanha, Grécia, estudou na Alemanha. Se mudou para a Amazônia com uma missão de grande importância para desenvolvimento sustentável e equilíbrio climático global.\\n\\n\\nPROPOSTA DA CIDADE CIRCULAR: Unir o modo de vida tradicional com às conquistas da ciência e utilizar a tecnologia moderna para possibilitar a coexistência harmoniosa com o meio ambiente, ajudando nossa espécie não apenas a sobreviver, mas também a prosperar e a desenvolver plenamente seu potencial criativo.\\n\\nA Amazon Guard é a plataforma que torna esse sonho possível, criando uma comunidade de pessoas com ideias afins que apoiam projetos socioambientais em benefício de toda a Humanidade.\\n\\nO objetivo final das iniciativas é desenvolver a base para o modelo de Cidade Circular – a comunidade planejada e intencional do Terceiro Milênio. Trata-se de um conceito único, onde a vida tradicional e simples, em contato com a natureza, convive com alta especialização e eficiência, alcançadas com o apoio da tecnologia de ponta.\\n\\nO conceito de cidade está sendo desenvolvido na região amazônica e poderá ser replicado e adaptado em outras áreas do mundo, onde as pessoas estejam dispostas a assumir a responsabilidade pelo planeta, viver uma vida plena e liderar a evolução consciente.\\n\\nATUALMENTE: Zbigniew está desenvolvendo barcos elétricos para ribeirinhos e movidos a energia solar em Manaus, na Amazônia brasileira. Buscando colaboradores e parceiros para www.e-uba.com\\n\\nOBJETIVO: até 2030 iniciar construção de modelo de Cidade Circular do Terceiro Milênio.\\nVIDEO com a simulação: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ADYQGYnQRx0\",\"currentPosition\":[{\"position\":\"CEO\",\"location\":\"Manaus, Amazonas, Brazil\",\"employmentType\":\"Full-time\",\"workplaceType\":\"On-site\",\"companyName\":\"Solalis - technology from Amazon Rainforest\",\"companyLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/search/results/all/?keywords=Solalis+-+technology+from+Amazon+Rainforest\",\"duration\":\"4 yrs 4 mos\",\"description\":\"A principal plataforma de eletromobilidade fluvial e urbana da Amazônia. Solalis LTDA é uma startup brasileira de eletromobilidade fundada em 2022, com sede em Manaus/AM, criada para viabilizar a transição da mobilidade fluvial para um modelo limpo, eficiente e escalável. \\n\\nAtuamos no coração da floresta, onde o rio é a principal estrada e onde a transição energética vai gerar impacto social e ambiental imediato e mensurável.\\n\\nNosso propósito é aplicar tecnologia para gerar impacto, promover desenvolvimento econômico sustentável e inclusão produtiva, proteger ecossistemas sensíveis, melhorar a qualidade de vida das populações ribeirinhas e contribuir de forma concreta para o equilíbrio climático global.\\n\\nÁreas de atuação:\\n•Pesquisa e Desenvolvimento (P&D)\\n•Tecnologia e industrialização local\\n•Formação comunitária\\n•Empreendedorismo sustentável\\n•Valorização da sociobiodiversidade.\\n\\nAo longo de mais de 5 anos Solalis vem construindo uma rede estratégica de parcerias que permite escalonamento rápido do negócio na Amazônia:\\n•Relacionamento com ONGs nacionais e internacionais\\n•Articulação com governos locais e instituições públicas\\n•Conexões com marketplaces e canais de comercialização\\n•Parcerias com fornecedores e indústria \\n•Experiência prática e protótipos testados com comunidades ribeirinhas\\n•Contatos diretos com lideranças comunitárias\\n\\nEsse capital relacional é um dos principais diferenciais da Solalis e reduz drasticamente o custo e o tempo de entrada em novos territórios.\\n\\nJUNTOS CONSTRUIMOS FUTURO QUE DESEJAMOS  \\nEletrificando o transporte fluvial    \\n•  reduzimos impactos ambientais \\n•  fortalecemos comunidades ribeirinhas  \\n•  protegemos a floresta amazônica\\n•  equilibramos clima global\",\"skills\":null,\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"May\",\"year\":2022,\"text\":\"May 2022\"},\"endDate\":{\"text\":\"Present\"}}],\"profileTopEducation\":[{\"schoolName\":\"Universidade Cidade de São Paulo (Unicid)\",\"schoolLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/501625/\",\"schoolId\":\"501625\",\"degree\":\"Master of Business Administration (M.B.A.)\",\"fieldOfStudy\":\"MBA in Development and Management of Real Estate Business\",\"period\":\"Jan 2011 - Sep 2012\",\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"Jan\",\"year\":2011,\"text\":\"Jan 2011\"},\"endDate\":{\"month\":\"Sep\",\"year\":2012,\"text\":\"Sep 2012\"},\"schoolLogo\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQGkw0oiHz7VgQ/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1733140903386/unicid_universidade_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=3ktXS-vSu4FEFAQV1I6kUecChqf0OAf5XMvTwaT-Dbc\",\"sizes\":[{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQGkw0oiHz7VgQ/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1733140903386/unicid_universidade_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=3ktXS-vSu4FEFAQV1I6kUecChqf0OAf5XMvTwaT-Dbc\",\"width\":400,\"height\":400},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQGkw0oiHz7VgQ/company-logo_200_200/company-logo_200_200/0/1733140903386/unicid_universidade_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=rtUiwwUrd1e_8Df6VLuAooWH5JXAPGiE9Ynhb_KEaVk\",\"width\":200,\"height\":200},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQGkw0oiHz7VgQ/company-logo_100_100/company-logo_100_100/0/1733140903386/unicid_universidade_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=xAsu02n2c0vI0THEdz0VkS8Dzs7Lf1CRzSGCZ19nsrw\",\"width\":100,\"height\":100}]}}],\"profileActions\":[],\"profilePicture\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D03AQFGbmya2zi1qQ/profile-displayphoto-shrink_800_800/profile-displayphoto-shrink_800_800/0/1727115823467?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=-JZ20JWOEQTnQaHeuU6MGeVY7xTnafduQLYu6mmcWeE\",\"sizes\":[{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D03AQFGbmya2zi1qQ/profile-displayphoto-shrink_800_800/profile-displayphoto-shrink_800_800/0/1727115823467?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=-JZ20JWOEQTnQaHeuU6MGeVY7xTnafduQLYu6mmcWeE\",\"width\":624,\"height\":624},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D03AQFGbmya2zi1qQ/profile-displayphoto-shrink_400_400/profile-displayphoto-shrink_400_400/0/1727115823499?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=NvESqwrpD85GbbsHxtQkjOxmmtp6ecmepl0m6QzPzJg\",\"width\":400,\"height\":400},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D03AQFGbmya2zi1qQ/profile-displayphoto-shrink_200_200/profile-displayphoto-shrink_200_200/0/1727115823499?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=luKUf3VNbmsnn7SZcWmoeShka5QmYTfwOBZsR7dG_2A\",\"width\":200,\"height\":200},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D03AQFGbmya2zi1qQ/profile-displayphoto-shrink_100_100/profile-displayphoto-shrink_100_100/0/1727115823499?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=N0gjTdBQCdV4a7U1DSNAS8o9fVst7rjYHrpytRVrgK8\",\"width\":100,\"height\":100}]},\"coverPicture\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D16AQGKZsPsDZ-uew/profile-displaybackgroundimage-shrink_350_1400/B4DZuVbb81KAAY-/0/1767738563755?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=x3GqkViCk2Ys5YLATZiiDAiPtzr4KuzmjT74GkOXvlw\",\"sizes\":[{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D16AQGKZsPsDZ-uew/profile-displaybackgroundimage-shrink_350_1400/B4DZuVbb81KAAY-/0/1767738563755?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=x3GqkViCk2Ys5YLATZiiDAiPtzr4KuzmjT74GkOXvlw\",\"width\":1400,\"height\":350},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D16AQGKZsPsDZ-uew/profile-displaybackgroundimage-shrink_200_800/B4DZuVbb81KAAU-/0/1767738563755?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=8h3bL0mAjE5s41at5wGfZCdbCrV_wmH4jKkE92rznuM\",\"width\":800,\"height\":200}]},\"photo\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D03AQFGbmya2zi1qQ/profile-displayphoto-shrink_800_800/profile-displayphoto-shrink_800_800/0/1727115823467?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=-JZ20JWOEQTnQaHeuU6MGeVY7xTnafduQLYu6mmcWeE\",\"profileLocales\":[{\"country\":\"BR\",\"language\":\"pt\"},{\"country\":\"ES\",\"language\":\"es\"},{\"country\":\"PL\",\"language\":\"pl\"},{\"country\":\"US\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"primaryLocale\":{\"country\":\"BR\",\"language\":\"pt\"},\"multiLocaleHeadline\":[{\"headline\":\"Amazonpreneur - CEO SOLALIS - BUILDING LIFE SUSTAINING SYSTEMS\",\"locale\":\"en_US\"},{\"headline\":\"Amazonpreneur - CEO SOLALIS - construindo CIDADE CIRCULAR na Amazônia\",\"locale\":\"pt_BR\"}],\"services\":{\"description\":\"Project Management\",\"media\":[],\"servicesList\":[],\"rating\":null,\"requestUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/zbigkozak/opportunities/services/request-proposal?servicePageVanityName=454456314035979643\"},\"experience\":[{\"position\":\"CEO\",\"location\":\"Manaus, Amazonas, Brazil\",\"employmentType\":\"Full-time\",\"workplaceType\":\"On-site\",\"companyName\":\"Solalis - technology from Amazon Rainforest\",\"companyLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/search/results/all/?keywords=Solalis+-+technology+from+Amazon+Rainforest\",\"duration\":\"4 yrs 4 mos\",\"description\":\"A principal plataforma de eletromobilidade fluvial e urbana da Amazônia. Solalis LTDA é uma startup brasileira de eletromobilidade fundada em 2022, com sede em Manaus/AM, criada para viabilizar a transição da mobilidade fluvial para um modelo limpo, eficiente e escalável. \\n\\nAtuamos no coração da floresta, onde o rio é a principal estrada e onde a transição energética vai gerar impacto social e ambiental imediato e mensurável.\\n\\nNosso propósito é aplicar tecnologia para gerar impacto, promover desenvolvimento econômico sustentável e inclusão produtiva, proteger ecossistemas sensíveis, melhorar a qualidade de vida das populações ribeirinhas e contribuir de forma concreta para o equilíbrio climático global.\\n\\nÁreas de atuação:\\n•Pesquisa e Desenvolvimento (P&D)\\n•Tecnologia e industrialização local\\n•Formação comunitária\\n•Empreendedorismo sustentável\\n•Valorização da sociobiodiversidade.\\n\\nAo longo de mais de 5 anos Solalis vem construindo uma rede estratégica de parcerias que permite escalonamento rápido do negócio na Amazônia:\\n•Relacionamento com ONGs nacionais e internacionais\\n•Articulação com governos locais e instituições públicas\\n•Conexões com marketplaces e canais de comercialização\\n•Parcerias com fornecedores e indústria \\n•Experiência prática e protótipos testados com comunidades ribeirinhas\\n•Contatos diretos com lideranças comunitárias\\n\\nEsse capital relacional é um dos principais diferenciais da Solalis e reduz drasticamente o custo e o tempo de entrada em novos territórios.\\n\\nJUNTOS CONSTRUIMOS FUTURO QUE DESEJAMOS  \\nEletrificando o transporte fluvial    \\n•  reduzimos impactos ambientais \\n•  fortalecemos comunidades ribeirinhas  \\n•  protegemos a floresta amazônica\\n•  equilibramos clima global\",\"skills\":null,\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"May\",\"year\":2022,\"text\":\"May 2022\"},\"endDate\":{\"text\":\"Present\"}},{\"position\":\"Project Developer\",\"location\":\"Manaus, Amazonas, Brazil\",\"employmentType\":\"Full-time\",\"workplaceType\":null,\"companyName\":\"E-UBÁ Amazônia - solar electric boats for the Amazon\",\"companyLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/search/results/all/?keywords=E-UB%C3%81+Amaz%C3%B4nia+-+solar+electric+boats+for+the+Amazon\",\"duration\":\"5 yrs 6 mos\",\"description\":\"E-UBÁ Amazônia ⚡ is reinventing water mobility - by building electric boats and charging stations, improves lives and gives a tool to the forest protectors to protect most important ecosystem on Earth 🌎 and effectively mitigate global climate change. \\n\\n\\nIn the Amazon Rainforest instead of roads are rivers. Great distances together with high fuel cost are preventing sustainable development and forest preservation. Protectors of world\'s biggest tropical forest are still using conventional boats that are causing many problems: run on expensive fossil fuel, motors are inefficient, complex and demand lots of maintenance, pollute the environment, make noise and cause accidents.\\nIntroducing electric boats we address the main problems of many communities: lack of energy, limited access to health care, education, air and water pollution, extractivism production waste, underdeveloped value chains, low connectivity and poor digitalization, very low Human Development Index.\\n\\n\\n~~\\nIn the Pan-Amazon region live 48 million people and almost everyone depends on water transportation somehow. Here instead of roads are rivers - 35 thousand km of waterways and around 30% of the population is accessible only by water. Riverside communities today are spending half of the income on fossil fuel to run boats and generate poor quality energy at home that comes from diesel generators.\\nIn general we address an economy based on cutting trees and burning the forest and propose to replace it with a new bioeconomy based on forest preservation and on using modern technology for support.\\n\\nWe know that from the Amazon Biom depends stabilization of climate on Earth and survival of Humanity. We are taking action to build a better future now.\",\"skills\":null,\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"Mar\",\"year\":2021,\"text\":\"Mar 2021\"},\"endDate\":{\"text\":\"Present\"}},{\"position\":\"Projects development and fundraising\",\"location\":\"Brasil\",\"employmentType\":null,\"workplaceType\":null,\"companyName\":\"Amazon Guard\",\"companyLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/amazon-guard/\",\"companyId\":\"72440171\",\"duration\":\"5 yrs 9 mos\",\"description\":\"EMPOWERING PEOPLE + PRESERVING FORESTS + PROTECTING NATURE. \\nAmazon Guard\'s mission is to raise the quality of living of the traditional Amazon communities, helping them to get access to basic health and education, renewable energy, improving their production and upgrading the value chain.\\n\\nThrough sustainable solutions and technology we support  people that conserve and make sustainable use of the Amazon ecosystem, preserving effectively this habitat of many still undiscovered species. \\n\\n  \\nFor millenniums traditional communities live in the forest planting and harvesting it and they are the best protectors of this habitat. Sadly their living conditions are vulnerable and they don\'t keep up with the progress of the technology. It puts in danger their lives and the Amazon with all its richness. \\n\\nRaising the local people\'s quality of living has a positive environmental impact and indirectly affects the rest of the world including yourself. If you also are enthusiastic about to preserve this magical place and save the planet, then join us in the effort to support the Amazon communities!\\n\\nwww.amazon-guard.com/p/initiatives-non-profit.html\",\"skills\":null,\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"Dec\",\"year\":2020,\"text\":\"Dec 2020\"},\"endDate\":{\"text\":\"Present\"},\"companyLogo\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4E0BAQEodb5qZRG_Sg/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1654722579251/amazon_guard_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=GrpqgauIDCRTyPTMUibffOAEJQWzUPXQ6E78-YtCwyc\",\"sizes\":[{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4E0BAQEodb5qZRG_Sg/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1654722579251/amazon_guard_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=GrpqgauIDCRTyPTMUibffOAEJQWzUPXQ6E78-YtCwyc\",\"width\":400,\"height\":400},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4E0BAQEodb5qZRG_Sg/company-logo_200_200/company-logo_200_200/0/1654722579251/amazon_guard_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=AlQll_CMtF5lnTUu9WGdBazgp880au7lFi-BEwPFeAc\",\"width\":200,\"height\":200},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4E0BAQEodb5qZRG_Sg/company-logo_100_100/company-logo_100_100/0/1654722579251/amazon_guard_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=yeB6_GiKe5F9R7BmVpzLZMnLtUKMoCuuDn4IbxTo-Nk\",\"width\":100,\"height\":100}]},\"companyUniversalName\":\"amazon-guard\"},{\"position\":\"Project Coordinator\",\"location\":\"Brazil\",\"employmentType\":null,\"workplaceType\":null,\"companyName\":\"Circular Cities Network\",\"companyLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/circularcity/\",\"companyId\":\"51699960\",\"duration\":\"8 yrs 2 mos\",\"description\":\"Circular City: open source community model and solution to the 21st century global challenges. \\n\\nThe concept brings to life a simplicity of living close to nature with easy access to knowledge and sophisticated technology. Masterplan for Circular City is an intelligent system of places for residents to get inspired everyday and for visitors to explore and to learn. Nature and architecture collaborate to provide shelter and sustenance.\\n\\nVision for the near future is the network of interconnected Circular Cities following the same model and principles, adopted to the local conditions and environment. Cooperating with local communities and government, there is a space for preserving tradition and culture, giving the most of value to people collaborative work and creativity.\\n\\nWe believe, that from exchange of knowledge and our collaboration depends global peace and prosperity for all and for future generations.\\n\\nWe are redesigning a love story between people and nature in a modern community, where with traditional and simple living close to nature, goes together high specialization and efficiency, achieved with support of newest technology.\\n\\nOnly by merging ancient wisdom with modern science we can live in harmony with natural environment, learning, practicing, redesigning and exchanging information, preserving universal values and culture.\\n\\nCircular City is a nonprofit project to assist human evolution and conserve Earth\'s biodiversity.\\n www.circular-city.com\",\"skills\":null,\"startDate\":