on/entrepreneurship\\n• Technology in the chemical industry (state of the art)\",\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"Feb\",\"year\":2020,\"text\":\"Feb 2020\"},\"endDate\":{\"month\":\"Mar\",\"year\":2022,\"text\":\"Mar 2022\"},\"period\":\"Feb 2020 - Mar 2022\",\"schoolLogo\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4D0BAQGiXwxmIVKUjQ/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1649448016709?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=uWXmZDOkQ3uZvUieSxNe_oq1YMV0R6ZZwA_Kd1TeoKA\",\"sizes\":[{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4D0BAQGiXwxmIVKUjQ/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1649448016709?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=uWXmZDOkQ3uZvUieSxNe_oq1YMV0R6ZZwA_Kd1TeoKA\",\"width\":400,\"height\":400},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4D0BAQGiXwxmIVKUjQ/company-logo_200_200/company-logo_200_200/0/1649448016709?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=p9MkgC8UO9DYlmAn_KDEAi8koZlJkFVCz72B-FshavA\",\"width\":200,\"height\":200},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4D0BAQGiXwxmIVKUjQ/company-logo_100_100/company-logo_100_100/0/1649448016709?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=trh10cQX1FoFPqxvf9Rh6BZzPaXetlJNBWfkPQURkX8\",\"width\":100,\"height\":100}]}},{\"schoolName\":\"Federal University of Technology - Parana\",\"schoolLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/15090756/\",\"schoolId\":\"15090756\",\"degree\":\"Bachelor\'s degree\",\"fieldOfStudy\":\"Control & Automation Engineering\",\"skills\":[\"Comunicação escrita\",\"Instrumentação\",\"Habilidades analíticas\",\"Automação\",\"Matlab\",\"Comandos elétricos\",\"Microcontroladores\",\"CLP (Controlador lógico programável)\",\"Gestão de stakeholders\",\"C#\",\"C (linguagem de programação)\",\"Banco de dados\",\"Comunicação\",\"Trabalho em equipe\",\"Engenharia\",\"Arduino\",\"MySQL\",\"Inglês\",\"Liderança de equipe\",\"Atenção a detalhes\",\"Microsoft Office\",\"Programação (computação)\"],\"description\":\"•\\tBachelor’s Degree in Control and Automation Engineering with an emphasis on control and microcontroller systems.\\n\\nH