ern\",\"location\":\"São Paulo, Brazil\",\"employmentType\":\"Internship\",\"workplaceType\":\"On-site\",\"companyName\":\"Bandeirantes Bauru Prod Industriais E Automotivos\",\"companyLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/bandeirantes-bauru-prod-industriais-e-automotivos/\",\"companyId\":\"24490635\",\"duration\":\"7 mos\",\"description\":\"Responsibilities:\\n• Order analysis and issuance of invoices\\n• Accounts payable/receivable entries\\n• Management of goods collection/shipping\\n• Website updating and maintenance\\n• Customer service\",\"skills\":[\"Microsoft Office\",\"Comunicação\",\"Comunicação escrita\",\"Vendas\",\"Trabalho em equipe\"],\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"May\",\"year\":2018,\"text\":\"May 2018\"},\"endDate\":{\"month\":\"Nov\",\"year\":2018,\"text\":\"Nov 2018\"},\"companyLogo\":null,\"companyUniversalName\":\"bandeirantes-bauru-prod-industriais-e-automotivos\"}],\"education\":[{\"schoolName\":\"UFSCar - Alumni\",\"schoolLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/35505/\",\"schoolId\":\"35505\",\"degree\":\"Postgraduate Lato Sensu - Specialization\",\"fieldOfStudy\":\"Industrial Chemical Processes\",\"skills\":[\"Comunicação escrita\",\"Controle de processos\",\"Habilidades analíticas\",\"Gestão de stakeholders\",\"Otimização de processos\",\"Comunicação\",\"Trabalho em equipe\",\"Engenharia\",\"Atenção a detalhes\",\"Microsoft Office\",\"Programação (computação)\"],\"description\":\"Specialization in Industrial Chemical Processes aimed at expanding knowledge and tools for analyzing and optimizing industrial processes, considering loss prevention, environmental impact mitigation, and profit maximization. The key areas of study include:\\n\\n• Principles of separation and purification (distillation, absorption, crystallization, and membranes)\\n• Sizing of pumping systems, filters, and heat exchangers\\n• Computational Fluid Dynamics (CFD)\\n• Integration/synthesis of industrial chemical processes\\n• Optimization of utility consumption\\n• Handling of solids (crystallization, drying, and fluidization)\\n• Wastewater treatment and control\\n• Chemical process safety and environmental impact assessment\\n• Financial analysis/economic engineering\\n• Innovation/entrepreneurship\\n• Technology in the chemical industry (state of the art)\",\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"Feb\",\"year\":2020,\"text\":\"Feb 2020\"},\"endDate\":{\"month\":\"Mar\",\"year\":2022,\"text\":\"Mar 2022\"},\"period\":\"Feb 2020 - Mar 2022\",\"schoolLogo\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4D0BAQGiXwxmIVKUjQ/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1649448016709?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=uWXmZDOkQ3uZvUieSxNe_oq1YMV0R6ZZwA_Kd1TeoKA\",\"sizes\":[{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4D0BAQGiXwxmIVKUjQ/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1649448016709?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=uWXmZDOkQ3uZvUieSxNe_oq1YMV0R6ZZwA_Kd1TeoKA\",\"width\":400,\"height\":400},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4D0BAQGiXwxmIVKUjQ/company-logo_200_200/company-logo_200_200/0/1649448016709?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=p9MkgC8UO9DYlmAn_KDEAi8koZlJkFVCz72B-FshavA\",\"width\":200,\"height\":200},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4D0BAQGiXwxmIVKUjQ/company-logo_100_100/company-logo_100_100/0/1649448016709?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=trh10cQX1FoFPqxvf9Rh6BZzPaXetlJNBWfkPQURkX8\",\"width\":100,\"height\":100}]}},{\"schoolName\":\"Federal University of Technology - Parana\",\"schoolLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/15090756/\",\"schoolId\":\"15090756\",\"degree\":\"Bachelor\'s degree\",\"fieldOfStudy\":\"Control & Automation Engineering\",\"skills\":[\"Comunicação escrita\",\"Instrumentação\",\"Habilidades analíticas\",\"Automação\",\"Matlab\",\"Comandos elétricos\",\"Microcontroladores\",\"CLP (Controlador lógico programável)\",\"Gestão de stakeholders\",\"C#\",\"C (linguagem de programação)\",\"Banco de dados\",\"Comunicação\",\"Trabalho em equipe\",\"Engenharia\",\"Arduino\",\"MySQL\",\"Inglês\",\"Liderança de equipe\",\"Atenção a detalhes\",\"Microsoft Office\",\"Programação (computação)\"],\"description\":\"•\\tBachelor’s Degree in Control and Automation Engineering with an emphasis on control and microcontroller systems.\\n\\nHighlights:\\n\\n• Awarded a scholarship in the program Jovens Talentos para Ciência (Capes), conducting scientific research in the area of microcontroller systems and supervisory systems\\n• Voluntary participation in a Scientific Initiation program focused on microcontroller systems and supervisory systems (after the program Jovens Talentos para Ciência)\\n• Awarded a scholarship in the program Ciências Sem Fronteiras (Capes) completing a 17-month exchange at the University of Idaho, USA\\n• Member of Solucaut, a junior enterprise of the Control and Automation Engineering program.\\n• Key knowledge in the areas of: microcontroller systems (C and C# programming languages, Proteus, MPLAB IDE), control systems (Matlab, Simulink), mech design (AutoCAD, SolidWorks), industrial automation (Siemens STEP7, FactoryIO, Ladder), MySQL, hydraulics, and pneumatics\",\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"Mar\",\"year\":2012,\"text\":\"Mar 2012\"},\"endDate\":{\"month\":\"Aug\",\"year\":2019,\"text\":\"Aug 2019\"},\"period\":\"Mar 2012 - Aug 2019\",\"schoolLogo\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E0BAQH-kvGmqFtRzw/company-logo_400_400/B4EZ7Qxjg8JIAU-/0/1781619112255/utfpr_oficial_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=D2wQjz4PFAR7OH6BjnZGVUPZ7vDbtGyJs5Nlgp_m2eE\",\"sizes\":[{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E0BAQH-kvGmqFtRzw/company-logo_400_400/B4EZ7Qxjg8JIAU-/0/1781619112255/utfpr_oficial_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=D2wQjz4PFAR7OH6BjnZGVUPZ7vDbtGyJs5Nlgp_m2eE\",\"width\":400,\"height\":400},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E0BAQH-kvGmqFtRzw/company-logo_200_200/B4EZ7Qxjg8JIAE-/0/1781619112255/utfpr_oficial_logo?e=1788998400&v=beta&t=8ZW2bkVE43sRC2E0bvtMcSROHNlbfUKJEFrdKoEArF4\",\"width\":200,\"height\":200},{\"url\":\"https:/