"Brito\",\"public_identifier\":\"alan-brito-876586a9\",\"linkedin_id\":\"ACoAABcLQVoBKwFY-wx9rDIKloJq7z2cwPh_dxM\",\"job_title\":\"CFO | Finance & Strategy | Mining Exploration | Brazil\",\"headline\":\"CFO | Finance & Strategy | Mining Exploration | Brazil\",\"company_name\":\"Solis Minerals\",\"location\":\"Federal District, Brazil\",\"industry\":null,\"photo_url\":null,\"cover_photo_url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D16AQFGe0lArzww7w/profile-displaybackgroundimage-shrink_350_1400/B4DZwras_TJsAc-/0/1770254947151?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=04CJf7RX8CC1o9I8ofVxk7JKrO1YL6Hlcr0rTu4hOTk\",\"about\":\"Professional with 8 years of experience as Financial Manager in a law firm, with strong involvement in strategic financial management, budgeting, cost control, management reporting, and direct support to partners’ decision-making.\\n\\nCurrently serving as Chief Financial Officer (CFO) of a mineral exploration company in Brazil, leading the finance function with a focus on financial structuring, governance, operational cost control, economic feasibility analysis of projects, and strategic support for growth and investment decisions in the mining sector.\\n\\nProfissional com 8 anos de experiência como responsável financeiro de escritório de advocacia, com atuação direta em gestão financeira estratégica, planejamento orçamentário, controle de despesas, relatórios gerenciais e suporte à tomada de decisão dos sócios.\\n\\nAtualmente atuo como CFO de empresa de pesquisa mineral no Brasil, liderando a área financeira com foco em estruturação financeira, governança, controle de custos operacionais, análise de viabilidade econômica de projetos e suporte estratégico às decisões de crescimento e investimento no setor mineral.\",\"skills\":[\"Finanças\",\"Auditoria\",\"Etiqueta ao telefone\",\"Equipamentos de escritório\",\"Capacidade de organização\",\"Resolução de problemas\",\"Revisão de documentos\",\"Conciliação bancária\",\"Comunicação\",\"Atenção a detalhes\",\"Microsoft Office\",\"Atendimento ao Cliente\",\"Microsoft Excel\",\"Liderança\",\"Microsoft Word\",\"Pesquisa\",\"Marketing\",\"Formação de equipes\",\"Gestão de vendas\",\"Controle interno\",\"Controle de estoque\"],\"experience\":[{\"position\":\"Diretor\",\"companyName\":\"Solis Minerals\",\"companyLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/solisminerals/\",\"companyId\":\"72068629\",\"companyUniversalName\":\"solisminerals\",\"companyLogo\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D560BAQFvuchL3OR-Jg/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1724039653391/solisminerals_logo?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=yF0jeT6ImvDRiAxYTA9v5mi1v8G9xaVceXCmj7QlLjw\",\"sizes\":[{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D560BAQFvuchL3OR-Jg/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1724039653391/solisminerals_logo?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=yF0jeT6ImvDRiAxYTA9v5mi1v8G9xaVceXCmj7QlLjw\",\"width\":400,\"height\":400},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D560BAQFvuchL3OR-Jg/company-logo_200_200/company-logo_200_200/0/1724039653391/solisminerals_logo?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=is2v0XeVEERrBW2GEc--avsbHIMg2t7QuO1-mOOUFkY\",\"width\":200,\"height\":200},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D560BAQFvuchL3OR-Jg/company-logo_100_100/company-logo_100_100/0/1724039653391/solisminerals_logo?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=wgy02J0iAZ5roDccQuzsbifCT-vjfucmyZiHUtlOzWQ\",\"width\":100,\"height\":100}]},\"location\":\"Brasília, Federal District, Brazil\",\"dateRange\":null,\"duration\":\"1 yr 7 mos\",\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"Mar\",\"year\":2025,\"text\":\"Mar 2025\"},\"endDate\":{\"text\":\"Present\"},\"description\":\"Involved in structuring and developing Solis Minerals operations in Brazil, with a focus on lithium exploration projects. Responsible for organizing the company’s local presence, including administrative, financial, and regulatory aspects.\\nSupported the implementation and consolidation of operations in the country, including corporate structuring assistance, monitoring of legal obligations, and compliance with the Brazilian regulatory environment.\\nProvided operational support to ongoing activities, ensuring internal processes and routines were properly structured and executed. Responsible for consolidating and reporting operational and strategic information to the headquarters in Australia, supporting project tracking and decision-making alignment.\\nContributed to the organization of key data and materials related to project development, with a strong focus on efficiency, governance, and operational support.\\n\\nAtuação na estruturação e desenvolvimento das operações da Solis Minerals no Brasil, com foco em projetos de exploração de lítio. Responsável pela organização da presença local da companhia, incluindo aspectos administrativos, financeiros e regulatórios.\\nParticipação na implantação e consolidação das atividades no país, com suporte à estruturação societária, acompanhamento de obrigações legais e adequação às exigências do ambiente regulatório brasileiro.\\nAtuação no suporte operacional às atividades da empresa, garantindo a organização e o funcionamento das rotinas internas. Responsável pela consolidação e envio de informações estratégicas e operacionais para a matriz na Austrália, contribuindo para o alinhamento das decisões e acompanhamento dos projetos.\\nEnvolvimento na organização de materiais e dados relevantes para acompanhamento dos ativos, com foco em eficiência, governança e suporte à evolução dos projetos de exploração.\",\"skills\":[],\"employmentType\":\"\",\"workplaceType\":\"\"},{\"position\":\"Diretor\",\"companyName\":\"Lightning Minerals\",\"companyLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/lightning-minerals/\",\"companyId\":\"89545100\",\"companyUniversalName\":\"lightning-minerals\",\"companyLogo\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D560BAQHGDOoqj3Xn2A/company-logo_400_400/B56Z3hjPPoIUAY-/0/1777605604906/lightning_minerals_logo?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=9BZVscyyaFKndDMnjT6bMKlXQVaf-Zc_JXYZBxs1Xvg\",\"sizes\":[{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D560BAQHGDOoqj3Xn2A/company-logo_400_400/B56Z3hjPPoIUAY-/0/1777605604906/lightning_minerals_logo?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=9BZVscyyaFKndDMnjT6bMKlXQVaf-Zc_JXYZBxs1Xvg\",\"width\":400,\"height\":400},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D560BAQHGDOoqj3Xn2A/company-logo_200_200/B56Z3hjPPoIUAI-/0/1777605604906/lightning_minerals_logo?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=g1OVI4jNaBexllc1NGsuE8izAb5L4Swri0GfzwmiaG4\",\"width\":200,\"height\":200},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D560BAQHGDOoqj3Xn2A/company-logo_100_100/B56Z3hjPPoIUAQ-/0/1777605604906/lightning_minerals_logo?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=gtSZjUeJydfISpSj5AcChu3amD4Ltk0nLwR550xCUGQ\",\"width\":100,\"height\":100}]},\"location\":\"Brasília, Federal District, Brazil\",\"dateRange\":null,\"duration\":\"1 yr 8 mos\",\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"Feb\",\"year\":2025,\"text\":\"Feb 2025\"},\"endDate\":{\"text\":\"Present\"},\"description\":\"Led the structuring and management of Lightning Minerals operations in Brazil, focusing on lithium exploration projects. Responsible for the company’s legal and institutional representation in the country, as well as overseeing administrative, financial, and regulatory activities.\\nExtensive experience in joint ventures with foreign capital, including contract negotiation, stakeholder management, and direct interaction with international investors. Provided strategic support to executive decision-making through management reporting and preparation of investor-ready materials.\\nCoordinated field teams alongside geologists, supporting exploration programs, mapping, and sampling activities. Actively contributed to the development of strategic materials, including corporate presentations and information memorandums (IM).\\nManaged budgets, operational cost control, and internal processes, with a strong focus on efficiency, governance, and compliance.\\n\\n\\nAtuação na estruturação e gestão das operações da Lightning Minerals no Brasil, com foco em projetos de exploração de lítio. Responsável pela representação legal e institucional da empresa no país, além da coordenação das áreas administrativa, financeira e regulatória.\\nExperiência na condução de joint ventures com capital estrangeiro, incluindo negociação contratual, gestão de stakeholders e interface com investidores internacionais. Apoio direto à tomada de decisão estratégica, com elaboração de relatórios gerenciais e consolidação de informações para o board.\\nCoordenação de equipes técnicas em campo, em conjunto com geólogos, apoiando programas de exploração, mapeamento e amostragem. Participação ativa no desenvolvimento de materiais estratégicos, como apresentações institucionais e information memorandums (IM).\\nGestão de budgets, controle de custos operacionais e implementação de processos internos com foco em eficiência, governança e compliance.\",\"skills\":[],\"employmentType\":\"Full-time\",\"workplaceType\":\"\"},{\"position\":\"Administrador Financeiro\",\"companyName\":\"Machado Gobbo Advogados\",\"companyLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/machado-gobbo-advogados/\",\"companyId\":\"5217727\",\"companyUniversalName\":\"machado-gobbo-advogados\",\"companyLogo\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C560BAQGOWAZGG_xg4g/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1631348134505?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=lr_oEeK_hhCnHwrxHPMXlktMYgOybJy03rt16zm2YJI\",\"sizes\":[{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C560BAQGOWAZGG_xg4g/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1631348134505?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=lr_oEeK_hhCnHwrxHPMXlktMYgOybJy03rt16zm2YJI\",\"width\":400,\"height\":400},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C560BAQGOWAZGG_xg4g/company-logo_200_200/company-logo_200_200/0/1631348134505?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=5ch7oLmaFbKLYtMqxDL3-i8h_JYzOHDfC03c0kCDEto\",\"width\":200,\"height\":200},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C560BAQGOWAZGG_xg4g/company-logo_10