\":\"166,269 followers\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4D0BAQExCz_Zuyq6Uw/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1631312441378?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=59ZWoruvFN6aFSXCx6m9BuWvA-K1v40W6Q5AsstcD4s\"}}]}],\"openProfile\":false,\"_meta\":{\"pagination\":{\"totalElements\":295,\"totalPages\":12,\"pageNumber\":1,\"previousElements\":0,\"pageSize\":25},\"scrapedAt\":\"2026-09-03T13:30:32.553Z\"},\"profileIdInSearch\":\"ACwAABCWFZEB9x1nwZs2WzeNSNG-o_vg7quHkYs\"}},{\"profile_url\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/apalombo\",\"full_name\":\"Alberto J. Palombo\",\"first_name\":\"Alberto J.\",\"last_name\":\"Palombo\",\"public_identifier\":\"apalombo\",\"linkedin_id\":\"ACoAAAK1k38BeipqrHtRt-KetNuUW1RysyHGuOQ\",\"job_title\":\"CEO @ Fomenta-X | DISC 4530 Chair - Rotary International / The Rotary Foundation / ESRAG |  Sustainable Energy, Water, Food, and Innovation\",\"headline\":\"CEO @ Fomenta-X | DISC 4530 Chair - Rotary International / The Rotary Foundation / ESRAG |  Sustainable Energy, Water, Food, and Innovation\",\"company_name\":\"Fomenta-X\",\"location\":\"Brasília, Federal District, Brazil\",\"industry\":null,\"photo_url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D03AQFSIcHYpeamFw/profile-displayphoto-shrink_800_800/B4DZUXftTiHAAc-/0/1739855943796?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=T7TpDyBSgJpEB8sWrA5TEYKybppeAhvHCy984fUFQ28\",\"cover_photo_url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4D16AQGTpgg_b2gF3Q/profile-displaybackgroundimage-shrink_350_1400/profile-displaybackgroundimage-shrink_350_1400/0/1516497694250?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=YGIpesns8GV4ZI5BPB3qnSBdJfQWQmzY8ECbgkVOkl4\",\"about\":\"Water-Energy-Food Nexus | Climate Action Leader & AI-Driven Systems Changemaker\\n\\nFour decades of driving transformational solutions in water security, energy resilience, and food systems. I specialize in turning challenges into breakthrough opportunities through nexus thinking, collaborative innovation, and AI agents that accelerate sustainable change and climate action.\\n\\nMy Climate Mission\\n\\nI\'m passionate about accelerating climate action through nexus solutions that simultaneously address water scarcity, energy transition, and food security. Every project creates ripple effects across interconnected systems, building resilience while reducing emissions through intelligent automation and data-driven insights.\\n\\nCore Impact Areas\\n\\n• Integrated Water-Energy Systems: Optimizing irrigation efficiency while generating clean energy \\n• Climate-Smart Agriculture: Developing water-efficient food production that reduces carbon footprint \\n• Renewable Energy Integration: Designing clean energy infrastructure supporting water treatment and food processing \\n• AI-Powered Climate Solutions: Deploying intelligent agents for predictive modeling, resource optimization, and automated sustainability monitoring \\n• Climate Adaptation Planning: Creating nexus-based strategies for drought resilience and flood management \\n• Carbon-Neutral Development: Implementing regional plans achieving net-zero emissions while ensuring resource security \\n• Emergency Climate Response: Deploying rapid nexus solutions for climate-induced disasters and resource conflicts\\n\\nWhy I Excel in Challenging Environments\\n\\nI thrive on complexity and uncertainty, seeing invisible connections between water, energy, and food systems to create exponential impact solutions. By leveraging AI agents for business intelligence and climate modeling, I transform traditional approaches into smart, adaptive systems. My optimistic vision and service-driven character inspire diverse teams to achieve breakthrough results in the most challenging scenarios.\\n\\nWhat Drives My Purpose\\n\\nMy commitment to \\\"service above self\\\" as a dedicated Rotarian and active leader of ESRAG and The Rotary Foundation shapes everything I do. This service ethic fuels my passion for helping others and ensuring every technical solution creates meaningful community impact worldwide.\\n\\nReady to accelerate climate action through integrated nexus solutions and AI-driven innovation? Let\'s connect and co-create the resilient future our planet needs.\",\"skills\":[\"Sustainability\",\"Sustainable Development\",\"Climate Change\",\"Water Management\",\"Water Resources\",\"Climate Change Adaptation\",\"Sustainable Agriculture\",\"Sustainable Energy\",\"Knowledge Management\",\"Project Management\",\"Management Consulting\",\"Waste Management\",\"Environmental Consulting\",\"Environmental Awareness\",\"Environmental Management Systems\",\"Environmental Issues\",\"Natural Resource Management\",\"Program Management\",\"Environmental Impact Assessment\",\"Environmental Policy\",\"Strategic Planning\",\"Capacity Building\",\"GIS\",\"Water\",\"Impactos das mudanças climáticas\",\"Adaptação às mudanças climáticas\",\"Project Planning\",\"Government\",\"Water Quality\",\"Sustainable Business\",\"Water Supply\",\"Environmental Science\",\"Natural Resources\",\"Waste\",\"Remediation\",\"Renewable Energy\",\"Water Treatment\",\"Surface Water\",\"Groundwater\",\"Remote Sensing\"],\"experience\":[{\"position\":\"Chief Executive Officer\",\"companyName\":\"Fomenta-X\",\"companyLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/fomenta-x/\",\"companyId\":\"69400619\",\"companyUniversalName\":\"fomenta-x\",\"companyLogo\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4E0BAQFbllDMD1DiRw/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1630631000810?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=_a3cZWKitYzdpuWFB7HyDXwg336KP0bqleifgalyY2o\",\"sizes\":[{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4E0BAQFbllDMD1DiRw/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1630631000810?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=_a3cZWKitYzdpuWFB7HyDXwg336KP0bqleifgalyY2o\",\"width\":400,\"height\":400},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4E0BAQFbllDMD1DiRw/company-logo_200_200/company-logo_200_200/0/1630631000810?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=3WjYhGT0AfHQYW8H1LSx3iJaBBw3nyEokyZMDi8nfio\",\"width\":200,\"heigh