},\"endDate\":{\"year\":1985,\"text\":\"1985\"},\"period\":\"1982 - 1985\",\"schoolLogo\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E0BAQG2_oE3A6EqBQ/company-logo_400_400/B4EZliJph.HIAY-/0/1758288320922/university_of_tennessee_knoxville_logo?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=vv8AyMphTeqF7llUW2lR9tVw-SFat0c0Oays8CGQByw\",\"sizes\":[{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E0BAQG2_oE3A6EqBQ/company-logo_400_400/B4EZliJph.HIAY-/0/1758288320922/university_of_tennessee_knoxville_logo?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=vv8AyMphTeqF7llUW2lR9tVw-SFat0c0Oays8CGQByw\",\"width\":400,\"height\":400},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E0BAQG2_oE3A6EqBQ/company-logo_200_200/B4EZliJph.HIAI-/0/1758288320922/university_of_tennessee_knoxville_logo?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=CBAK7AGARs27mgqv_8VPOVw5SjGX4hUpEa-6Rx8BASw\",\"width\":200,\"height\":200},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E0BAQG2_oE3A6EqBQ/company-logo_100_100/B4EZliJph.HIAQ-/0/1758288320922/university_of_tennessee_knoxville_logo?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=FrZVppxQOGble2SxLKcM37F8eh_lhNNISRe3jXxWJhU\",\"width\":100,\"height\":100}]}},{\"schoolName\":\"Pontifícia Universidade Católica do Rio Grande do Sul\",\"schoolLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/20459/\",\"schoolId\":\"20459\",\"degree\":\"Master of Business Administration - MBA\",\"fieldOfStudy\":\"Innovation and Technology for Businesses: AI\",\"skills\":[],\"description\":\"Currently pursuing an MBA in Business Technology: AI, Data Science & Big Data at PUCRS - A comprehensive program that combines strategic business acumen with cutting-edge technology expertise. This advanced curriculum is deepening my knowledge in artificial intelligence implementation, advanced data science methodologies, big data architecture, and predictive analytics. The program focuses on practical applications of machine learning, data visualization, digital transformation strategies, and innovation management to solve real-world business challenges. Through case studies and hands-on projects, I\'m developing the skills to lead data-driven initiatives, optimize business processes through AI solutions, and drive organizational growth in the digital economy. This MBA is positioning me to bridge the gap between technology and business strategy, enabling me to make informed decisions that leverage data insights for competitive advantage and sustainable innovation.\",\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"Jan\",\"year\":2025,\"text\":\"Jan 2025\"},\"endDate\":{\"month\":\"Jun\",\"year\":2026,\"text\":\"Jun 2026\"},\"period\":\"Jan 2025 - Jun 2026\",\"schoolLogo\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQGjDmaGTu3slw/company-logo_400_400/B4DZoSU4HEGQAY-/0/1761244054464/pucrs_logo?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=GqOkOWlDTDfi9AHIafaLJmZ30r8JEjCf3Vjdeb-LKAc\",\"sizes\":[{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQGjDmaGTu3slw/company-logo_400_400/B4DZoSU4HEGQAY-/0/1761244054464/pucrs_logo?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=GqOkOWlDTDfi9AHIafaLJmZ30r8JEjCf3Vjdeb-LKAc\",\"width\":400,\"height\":400},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQGjDmaGTu3slw/company-logo_200_200/B4DZoSU4HEGQAI-/0/1761244054464/pucrs_logo?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=aW7E9aW4zIM9GBDI9Bsjrh-gWIzP8hIrY9Wo3IGt8JM\",\"width\":200,\"height\":200},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQGjDmaGTu3slw/company-logo_100_100/B4DZoSU4HEGQAQ-/0/1761244054464/pucrs_logo?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=DK23qBlrhxY7W2rhxvnrZIv0xPscDYg39W6dE-vFKTo\",\"width\":100,\"height\":100}]}}],\"certifications\":[],\"languages\":[{\"name\":\"English\",\"proficiency\":\"Native or bilingual proficiency\"},{\"name\":\"Español\",\"proficiency\":\"Native or bilingual proficiency\"},{\"name\":\"Esperanto\",\"proficiency\":\"Limited working proficiency\"},{\"name\":\"French\",\"proficiency\":\"Limited working proficiency\"},{\"name\":\"Italian\",\"proficiency\":\"Limited working proficiency\"},{\"name\":\"Português\",\"proficiency\":\"Native or bilingual proficiency\"}],\"projects\":[],\"connections_count\":3221,\"followers_count\":3409,\"open_to_work\":false,\"hiring\":false,\"premium\":true,\"verified\":true,\"phone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"website\":\"\",\"source\":\"harvestapi_full\",\"raw_profile\":{\"id\":\"ACoAAAK1k38BeipqrHtRt-KetNuUW1RysyHGuOQ\",\"publicIdentifier\":\"apalombo\",\"linkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/apalombo\",\"firstName\":\"Alberto J.\",\"lastName\":\"Palombo\",\"emails\":[],\"headline\":\"CEO @ Fomenta-X | DISC 4530 Chair - Rotary International / The Rotary Foundation / ESRAG |  Sustainable Energy, Water, Food, and Innovation\",\"websites\":[\"https://linktr.ee/apalombo\"],\"openToWork\":false,\"hiring\":false,\"premium\":true,\"influencer\":false,\"memorialized\":false,\"creator\":true,\"location\":{\"linkedinText\":\"Brasília, Federal District, Brazil\",\"countryCode\":\"BR\",\"parsed\":{\"text\":\"Brasília, Brazil\",\"countryCode\":\"BR\",\"regionCode\":null,\"country\":\"Brazil\",\"countryFull\":\"Brazil\",\"state\":\"Distrito Federal\",\"city\":\"Brasília\"}},\"objectUrn\":\"45454207\",\"registeredAt\":\"2009-04-27T18:05:06.617Z\",\"topSkills\":[\"Sustainable Development\",\"Strategic Planning\",\"Sustainability\",\"Water Management\",\"Climate Change Adaptation\"],\"connectionsCount\":3221,\"followerCount\":3409,\"verified\":true,\"about\":\"Water-Energy-Food Nexus | Climate Action Leader & AI-Driven Systems Changemaker\\n\\nFour decades of driving transformational solutions in water security, energy resilience, and food systems. I specialize in turning challenges into breakthrough opportunities through nexus thinking, collaborative innovation, and AI agents that accelerate sustainable change and climate action.\\n\\nMy Climate Mission\\n\\nI\'m passionate about accelerating climate action through nexus solutions that simultaneously address water scarcity, energy transition, and food security. Every project creates ripple effects across interconnected systems, building resilience while reducing emissions through intelligent automation and data-driven insights.\\n\\nCore Impact Areas\\n\\n• Integrated Water-Energy Systems: Optimizing irrigation efficiency while generating clean energy \\n• Climate-Smart Agriculture: Developing water-efficient food production that reduces carbon footprint \\n• Renewable Energy Integration: Designing clean energy infrastructure supporting water treatment and food processing \\n• AI-Powered Climate Solutions: Deploying intelligent agents for predictive modeling, resource optimization, and automated sustainability monitoring \\n• Climate Adaptation Planning: Creating nexus-based strategies for drought resilience and flood management \\n• Carbon-Neutral Development: Implementing regional plans achieving net-zero emissions while ensuring resource security \\n• Emergency Climate Response: Deploying rapid nexus solutions for climate-induced disasters and resource conflicts\\n\\nWhy I Excel in Challenging Environments\\n\\nI thrive on complexity and uncertainty, seeing invisible connections between water, energy, and food systems to create exponential impact solutions. By leveraging AI agents for business intelligence and climate modeling, I transform traditional approaches into smart, adaptive systems. My optimistic vision and service-driven character inspire diverse teams to achieve breakthrough results in the most challenging scenarios.\\n\\nWhat Drives My Purpose\\n\\nMy commitment to \\\"service above self\\\" as a dedicated Rotarian and active leader of ESRAG and The Rotary Foundation shapes everything I do. This service ethic fuels my passion for helping others and ensuring every technical solution creates meaningful community impact worldwide.\\n\\nReady to accelerate climate action through integrated nexus solutions and AI-driven innovation? Let\'s connect and co-create the resilient future our planet needs.\",\"currentPosition\":[{\"position\":\"Chief Executive Officer\",\"location\":\"Brasília, DF\",\"employmentType\":\"Full-time\",\"workpl