ations of machine learning, data visualization, digital transformation strategies, and innovation management to solve real-world business challenges. Through case studies and hands-on projects, I\'m developing the skills to lead data-driven initiatives, optimize business processes through AI solutions, and drive organizational growth in the digital economy. This MBA is positioning me to bridge the gap between technology and business strategy, enabling me to make informed decisions that leverage data insights for competitive advantage and sustainable innovation.\",\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"Jan\",\"year\":2025,\"text\":\"Jan 2025\"},\"endDate\":{\"month\":\"Jun\",\"year\":2026,\"text\":\"Jun 2026\"},\"period\":\"Jan 2025 - Jun 2026\",\"schoolLogo\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQGjDmaGTu3slw/company-logo_400_400/B4DZoSU4HEGQAY-/0/1761244054464/pucrs_logo?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=GqOkOWlDTDfi9AHIafaLJmZ30r8JEjCf3Vjdeb-LKAc\",\"sizes\":[{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQGjDmaGTu3slw/company-logo_400_400/B4DZoSU4HEGQAY-/0/1761244054464/pucrs_logo?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=GqOkOWlDTDfi9AHIafaLJmZ30r8JEjCf3Vjdeb-LKAc\",\"width\":400,\"height\":400},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQGjDmaGTu3slw/company-logo_200_200/B4DZoSU4HEGQAI-/0/1761244054464/pucrs_logo?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=aW7E9aW4zIM9GBDI9Bsjrh-gWIzP8hIrY9Wo3IGt8JM\",\"width\":200,\"height\":200},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQGjDmaGTu3slw/company-logo_100_100/B4DZoSU4HEGQAQ-/0/1761244054464/pucrs_logo?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=DK23qBlrhxY7W2rhxvnrZIv0xPscDYg39W6dE-vFKTo\",\"width\":100,\"height\":100}]}}],\"certifications\":[],\"projects\":[],\"volunteering\":[{\"role\":\"Charter Member at RC Brasília International - D4530\",\"organizationName\":\"Rotary International\",\"duration\":\"Nov 2011 - Present · 14 yrs 11 mos\",\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"Nov\",\"year\":2011,\"text\":\"Nov 2011\"},\"endDate\":{\"text\":\"Present\"},\"description\":\"Rotary is a worldwide organization of business and professional leaders that provides humanitarian service and encourages high ethical standards in all vocations.. Rotary’s main objective is service — in the community, in the workplace, and around the globe. I am one of 1.2 million Rotarians who make up more than 34,000 Rotary clubs in nearly every country in the world share a dedication to the ideal of Service Above Self. Rotary clubs are open to people of all cultures and ethnicities and are not affiliated with any political or religious organizations.\",\"cause\":\"Social Services\"},{\"role\":\"Environmental Sustainability Rotary Action Group (ESRAG) - Charter Member\",\"organizationName\":\"Rotary International\",\"duration\":\"Jun 2015 - Present · 11 yrs 4 mos\",\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"Jun\",\"year\":2015,\"text\":\"Jun 2015\"},\"endDate\":{\"text\":\"Present\"},\"description\":\"We formed ESRAG to empower members of the Rotary Family worldwide to take actions to sustain our environment, particularly to stabilize our climate. ESRAG provides an organizing point and informational resources to share information with clubs and communities about sustainable practices and the global humanitarian crisis of climate change. Our action model: Identify environmental leaders within the Rotary movement, assist them in initiating environmental service projects that are meaningful to THEM, help where we can, and acknowledge and publicize their awesome work.\",\"cause\":\"Social Services\"}],\"receivedRecommendations\":[{\"givenBy\":\"William Cosgrove\",\"givenAt\":\"February 17, 2018\",\"givenByLink\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/william-cosgrove-1273918\",\"givenByHeadline\":\"President at Ecoconsult Inc.\",\"givenByPicture\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C5603AQFNYR6_-9wxwQ/profile-displayphoto-shrink_400_400/profile-displayphoto-shrink_400_400/0/1516357777664?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=98XpvqmenK5ox1TBu8jgnvRXej4SvONlsYB7qTfwh0o\",\"sizes\":[{\"url\