members from 75 countries who speak more than 80 languages. Our mission is to strengthen the impact of Rotary’s grants by assisting Rotarians in planning projects and safeguarding Foundation funds. \\n\\nWhat we do:\\n1. Serve as consultants to Rotary staff and Rotarians who are planning and implementing grant projects\\n2. Assist The Rotary Foundation Trustees with the grant funding process by reviewing grant applications\\n3. Evaluate the implementation of projects that have been funded by Foundation grants to ensure that the funds are being used properly.\\n4. Perform programmatic audits to ensure that Foundation grant funds are being used in accordance with the terms and conditions for Rotary grants and that stewardship guidelines are followed.\\n5. Carry out evaluations and interviews associated with Rotary’s Grant Model Evaluation as well as other Rotary initiatives and partnerships.\",\"startDate\":{\"text\":\"Technical Reviewer\"},\"endDate\":{\"text\":\"TRF Cadre\"},\"companyLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/rotary-international/\",\"logo\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4E0BAQFckn4J8pboCw/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1630566773837/rotary_international_logo?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=bBWJpfNvCu2Htzs-3pknwmO5se4mgpho75S8aZDWbAA\"},{\"name\":\"Inter-American Water Resources Network (IWRN)\",\"positionHeld\":\"Executive Director and Secretary · May 1994 - Present\",\"description\":null,\"startDate\":null,\"endDate\":null,\"companyLinkedinUrl\":null,\"logo\":null}],\"causes\":[\"Civil Rights and Social Action\",\"Economic Empowerment\",\"Education\",\"Environment\",\"Health\",\"Human Rights\",\"Disaster and Humanitarian Relief\",\"Politics\",\"Science and Technology\",\"Social Services\"],\"featured\":{\"images\":[],\"link\":null,\"title\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"slides\":[{\"title\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"description\":null,\"url\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7377099286255153152?updateEntityUrn=ur