cMtno5nHA1YSKE\",\"width\":100,\"height\":100}]}}],\"certifications\":[],\"languages\":[{\"name\":\"Espanhol\",\"proficiency\":\"Full professional proficiency\"},{\"name\":\"Inglês\",\"proficiency\":\"Full professional proficiency\"},{\"name\":\"Italiano\",\"proficiency\":\"Limited working proficiency\"}],\"projects\":[],\"connections_count\":5111,\"followers_count\":5710,\"open_to_work\":false,\"hiring\":false,\"premium\":false,\"verified\":true,\"phone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"website\":\"\",\"source\":\"harvestapi_full\",\"raw_profile\":{\"id\":\"ACoAAALs1YUBjpzOnkbkXcHfZyEwg3IMRg_tJY8\",\"publicIdentifier\":\"deluca080402\",\"linkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/deluca080402\",\"firstName\":\"Antonio\",\"lastName\":\"De Luca\",\"emails\":[],\"headline\":\"Diretor Regional\",\"openToWork\":false,\"hiring\":false,\"premium\":false,\"influencer\":false,\"memorialized\":false,\"creator\":true,\"location\":{\"linkedinText\":\"Brasília, Federal District, Brazil\",\"countryCode\":\"BR\",\"parsed\":{\"text\":\"Brasília, Brazil\",\"countryCode\":\"BR\",\"regionCode\":null,\"country\":\"Brazil\",\"countryFull\":\"Brazil\",\"state\":\"Distrito Federal\",\"city\":\"Brasília\"}},\"objectUrn\":\"49075589\",\"registeredAt\":\"2009-07-05T18:33:44.080Z\",\"topSkills\":[\"Vendas\",\"Gestão\",\"Direção executiva\",\"Liderança\",\"Trabalho em equipe\"],\"connectionsCount\":5111,\"followerCount\":5710,\"verified\":true,\"about\":\"🌟 Executivo com mais de duas décadas de trajetória em multinacionais, consolidando uma carreira marcada pela entrega de resultados excepcionais em projetos estratégicos que ultrapassam R$ 500 milhões e pela liderança direta de equipes com mais de 5 mil profissionais.\\n\\n📈 Reconhecido pela habilidade em transformar desafios complexos em oportunidades de crescimento, atuo com foco em gestão estratégica, liderança de alta performance e vendas, construindo organizações mais sólidas, competitivas e preparadas para o futuro.\\n\\n🌍 Minha experiência internacional inclui a condução de projetos e negociações com clientes e parceiros na Ásia, Europa e Estados Unidos, o que me permitiu desenvolver uma visão global de negócios e a capacidade de adaptar estratégias a diferentes culturas e mercados.\\n\\n💡 Minha jornada é pautada pela convicção de que a verdadeira liderança vai além de números: ela está em formar pessoas, criar culturas vencedoras e gerar impacto sustentável nos negócios e na sociedade.\\n\\n🔥 Minha missão é inspirar, transformar e entregar resultados que transcendem o curto prazo, conectando visão estratégica, disciplina de execução e liderança humana para alcançar excelência empresarial.\\n\\n\\n🌟 Senior Executive with over 20 years of experience in multinational companies, leading large-scale projects worth more than R$ 500 million and managing high-performance teams of over 5,000 professionals.\\n\\n📈 Recognized for the ability to turn complex challenges into growth opportunities, I specialize in strategic management, leadership, and sales, consistently building stronger, more competitive organizations ready for the future.\\n\\n🌍 My international background includes leading projects and negotiations with clients and partners across Asia, Europe, and the United States, developing a truly global business perspective and the adaptability to navigate diverse markets and cultural contexts.\\n\\n💡 My career is guided by the belief that true leadership goes beyond numbers — it is about developing people, shaping winning cultures, and generating sustainable impact for businesses and society.\\n\\n🚀 Throughout my journey, I have spearheaded expansion initiatives in highly competitive markets, designed innovative management models, and executed commercial strategies that drove market share growth and profitability — always with a global outlook and strong local execution.\\n\\n🔥 My mission is to inspire, transform, and deliver results that go beyond the short term, combining strategic vision, execution excellence, and human leadership to achieve lasting business success.\",\"currentPosition\":[{\"position\":\"Sócio Diretor regional\",\"location\":\"Brazil\",\"employmentType\":\"Full-time\",\"workplaceType\":\"Hybrid\",\"companyName\":\"Kmove Transportes e Logistica\",\"companyLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/kmove-transportes-e-logistica/\",\"companyId\":\"94805586\",\"duration\":\"11 mos\",\"description\":\"Sócio-diretor na KMove Transportes! Responsável pela operação e negociação de novos contratos com embarcadores, indústrias e varejo!\",\"skills\":[\"Desenvolvimento estratégico de negócios\"],\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"Nov\",\"year\":2025,\"text\":\"Nov 2025\"},\"endDate\":{\"text\":\"Present\"},\"companyLogo\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQHaVnn_ooc-TA/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1696368990408/kmove_transportes_e_logistica_logo?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=IhPU2z8w2z8NsF8lSFnbMjbdRkGNtkSPzp3ntRoIlo8\",\"sizes\":[{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQHaVnn_ooc-TA/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1696368990408/kmove_transportes_e_logistica_logo?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=IhPU2z8w2z8NsF8lSFnbMjbdRkGNtkSPzp3ntRoIlo8\",\"width\":400,\"height\":400},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQHaVnn_ooc-TA/company-logo_200_200/company-logo_200_200/0/1696368990408/kmove_transportes_e_logistica_logo?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=4zQH6opK0sn_c1N3_WWWQ96bsuKJfmFFX0HAWHy_kS8\",\"width\":200,\"height\":200},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQHaVnn_ooc-TA/company-logo_100_100/company-logo_100_100/0/1696368990408/kmove_transportes_e_logistica_logo?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=Vkbk3kfbXonZt9uxDLiADmvOti8Ia8NXQakMC2Ri11s\",\"width\":100,\"height\":100}]},\"companyUniversalName\":\"kmove-transportes-e-logistica\"}],\"profileTopEducation\":[{\"schoolName\":\"FGV - Fundação Getulio Vargas\",\"schoolLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/8175/\",\"schoolId\":\"8175\",\"degree\":\"Graduate\