le\":\"Profissional Alta Performance\",\"subtitle\":\"O melhor conteúdo para alcançar a performance na vida pessoal e profissional.\",\"link\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/newsletters/7091880917077504000\",\"caption\":\"Published weekly\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D12AQHifgHV2PZuNg/series-logo_image-shrink_300_300/series-logo_image-shrink_300_300/0/1723815403909?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=rmsep_szLX0k2VErO6HvU97PFjRzhGlDS5OH0CAOK6w\"}}]},{\"interestName\":\"Schools\",\"elements\":[{\"title\":\"UniCEUB - Centro Universitário de Brasília\",\"subtitle\":null,\"link\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/school/15143940/\",\"caption\":\"76,925 followers\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4D0BAQFxi2WPQgBHFA/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1630495988224/uniceub_centro_universitario_de_brasilia_logo?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=BvyTcF0gbpb6uXFOnWnKJjCyGFbo0VkwUWFKykmsOHI\"}},{\"title\":\"Emeritus\",\"subtitle\":null,\"link\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/school/10367223/\",\"caption\":\"836,568 followers\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4E0BAQEPQkzhbxNNSg/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1630627850485/emeritused_logo?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=4kDzBXs6bhUZV65S2A89UZq3i0aNJYUbhTvTGPwwBBY\"}}]}],\"openProfile\":false,\"_meta\":{\"pagination\":{\"totalElements\":295,\"totalPages\":12,\"pageNumber\":1,\"previousElements\":0,\"pageSize\":25},\"scrapedAt\":\"2026-09-03T13:30:32.056Z\"},\"profileIdInSearch\":\"ACwAAALs1YUB8n_FaBivzQTLGd_dnGPtN97KBK4\"}},{\"profile_url\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/guilherme-branco-b3994646\",\"full_name\":\"Guilherme Branco\",\"first_name\":\"Guilherme\",\"last_name\":\"Branco\",\"public_identifier\":\"guilherme-branco-b3994646\",\"linkedin_id\":\"ACoAAAm__t0BuQSUxNCAEOZnUuo30PIMaXQRBOo\",\"job_title\":\"Creative Director at Lola\\\\​TBWA Brasil\",\"headline\":\"Creative Director at Lola\\\\​TBWA Brasil\",\"company_name\":\"Lola\\\\TBWA Brasil\",\"location\":\"Federal District, Brazil\",\"industry\":null,\"photo_url\":null,\"cover_photo_url\":null,\"about\":\"Olá! Eu sou o Guilherme Branco e atualmente trabalho como Diretor de Criação na Lola\\\\TBWA Brasil. Minha formação é em Comunicação Social – Publicidade e Propaganda pela Universidade Positivo e também tenho cursos de especialização em criatividade, roteiro, planejamento e dados.\\n\\nAo longo da minha carreira, trabalhei em agências no Brasil, na Argentina e em Portugal, atendendo grandes clientes como Banco do Brasil, Coca-Cola, Unilever, Burger King, Nivea, Bimbo, CAIXA, entre outros.\\n\\nEm 2014, ganhei o Young Lions Film na Argentina e representei o país na competição em Cannes. Além dos prêmios nacionais e internacionais, destaco também ter participado da criação das propostas vencedoras das licitações de publicidade do Banco do Brasil em 2011, 2018 e 2024.\\n__\\n\\nHi! I’m Guilherme Branco, Creative Director at Lola\\\\TBWA Brazil. I graduated in Advertising from Universidade Positivo and have taken specialized courses in creativity, copywriting, strategy, and data.\\n\\nOver the years, I’ve worked at agencies across Brazil, Argentina, and Portugal, creating work for major brands like Banco do Brasil, Coca-Cola, Unilever, Burger King, Nivea, Bimbo, CAIXA, and more.\\n\\nBack in 2014, I won Young Lions Film in Argentina and represented the country in Cannes. On top of national and international awards, a big highlight for me was helping create the winning creative pitches for Banco do Brasil’s major ad tenders in 2011, 2018, and 2024.\",\"skills\":[],\"experience\":[{\"position\":\"Diretor de criação\",\"companyName\":\"Lola\\\\TBWA Brasil\",\"companyLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/lola-tbwa-brasil/\",\"companyId\":\"111434126\",\"companyUniversalName\":\"lola-tbwa-brasil\",\"companyLogo\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQHrN9FJuL48_Q/company-logo_400_400/B4DZ9sNDMLJwAU-/0/1784226788347/lola_tbwa_brasil_logo?e=1790208000&v=be