(28, 22, 57, '[{\"profile_url\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/pepasiqueira\",\"full_name\":\"Pedro Paulo Siqueira\",\"first_name\":\"Pedro Paulo\",\"last_name\":\"Siqueira\",\"public_identifier\":\"pepasiqueira\",\"linkedin_id\":\"ACoAABVG2IEBbB3epNf35v0fY8E_nmH1oS6Bzck\",\"job_title\":\"Brazilian Program School Head\",\"headline\":\"Brazilian Program School Head\",\"company_name\":\"Akron Global School\",\"location\":\"São Paulo, São Paulo, Brazil\",\"industry\":null,\"photo_url\":null,\"cover_photo_url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D16AQFAH_uGLGMNPQ/profile-displaybackgroundimage-shrink_350_1400/B4DZ6xcJ3iKQAU-/0/1781093408663?e=1792022400&v=beta&t=EGckZY-5b4VCd2O-igxqjuvQcZDjXP2b5JCp9xQ9NGg\",\"about\":\"School consultant and academic leader with extensive experience in Brazilian and international schools. His work combines educational leadership, pedagogical governance, regulatory expertise, school management, and engagement with families and communities.\\nSpecialized in adapting international educational models to the Brazilian context, he advises investors, school owners, boards of directors, and educational institutions in building sustainable operations aligned with Brazil’s legal, cultural, and academic requirements. His expertise includes bilingual programs, international curricula, institutional development, regulatory compliance, and educational technology implementation.\\nAs an educator, he has taught Mathematics for more than 30 years to students in both the Brazilian educational system and international programs, using practical, creative, and student-centered approaches. His career integrates classroom experience, business management, and school leadership, enabling him to connect strategy, curriculum, operations, and educational outcomes.\\nHe has experience with platforms such as WAE, Moodle, Google Workspace for Education, Microsoft Teams, Brightspace, and other digital learning environments, supporting schools in their digital transformation and alignment with Brazilian educational guidelines.\\n\\nCore Competencies\\n• Educational leadership and school management\\n• Consulting for international and bilingual schools\\n• Pedagogical governance and curriculum development\\n• Regulatory compliance and relations with educational authorities\\n• Implementation of Brazilian and international programs\\n• Educational technology and digital transformation\\n• Team development and professional training\\n• Bilingual communication (Portuguese and English)\\n• Intercultural competence\\n• Business management and educational operations\\n\\nValue Proposition\\nTransforming global educational models into solutions tailored to the Brazilian context while preserving academic quality, regulatory compliance, cultural relevance, and operational excellence.\",\"skills\":[\"pensamento estrategico\",\"gerenciamento de mudanças\",\"administracao escolar\",\"consultoria\",\"Consultoria\",\"Treinamento educacional\",\"Treinamentos em tecnologia da informação\",\"Gestão de documentos\",\"Educação\",\"Classificação e reclassificação escolar\",\"Microsoft Office\",\"Ensino superior\",\"Mídias sociais\",\"Ciência\",\"Inglês\",\"ESL (Inglês como segunda língua)\",\"Matemática\",\"Estatística\",\"Videoconferência\",\"Observação\"],\"experience\":[{\"position\":\"Brazilian Program Director\",\"companyName\":\"Akron Global School\",\"companyLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/akron-global-school/\",\"companyId\":\"135824422\",\"companyUniversalName\":\"akron-global-school\",\"companyLogo\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQEHrDSrIAP7XQ/company-logo_400_400/B4DZ_8qBoMKIAY-/0/1786650303619/akron_global_school_logo?e=1792022400&v=beta&t=DLgwM27zmisYqFpJ49mHsC2hZYiUZM2IDcJz6v1CTSM\",\"sizes\":[{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQEHrDSrIAP7XQ/company-logo_400_400/B4DZ_8qBoMKIAY-/0/1786650303619/akron_global_school_logo?e=1792022400&v=beta&t=DLgwM27zmisYqFpJ49mHsC2hZYiUZM2IDc