, and other national organizations as MoH, MCTI, ANVISA, ABDI, BNDES and FINEP\\nNine different Partnerships (PDP) and in-licensing for the development of products were established. My role was to lead the whole process with private pharmaceutical Co. and the MoH\",\"skills\":null,\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"Jun\",\"year\":2011,\"text\":\"Jun 2011\"},\"endDate\":{\"month\":\"Aug\",\"year\":2016,\"text\":\"Aug 2016\"},\"companyLogo\":null},{\"position\":\"Senior Consultant\",\"location\":null,\"employmentType\":\"Full-time\",\"workplaceType\":null,\"companyName\":\"K2 Achievements\",\"companyUniversalName\":\"k2-achievements\",\"companyLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/k2-achievements/\",\"companyId\":\"286961\",\"duration\":\"3 yrs 6 mos\",\"description\":\"Senior Consultant at K2 Achievements, a business consultancy located in São Paulo. Development of proposals and conduction of projects in the health care sector of Brasil and Africa, having the Ministry of Health as one of the main client. I conducted data collections and analyzed studies of economic and financial viability for project management and new businesses in the pharmacy sectors, hospitals, and health insurance. The main projects were:\\n•\\tI released the first Private Health Plan (Self-insurance) in Angola\\n•\\tI developed a proposal of Reform of the National Health System of Angola\\n•\\tI led teams for the development of the Strategic Plan in 15 municipal hospitals in Africa\",\"skills\":null,\"startDate\":{\"year\":2008,\"text\":\"2008\"},\"endDate\":{\"month\":\"Jun\",\"year\":2011,\"text\":\"Jun 2011\"},\"companyLogo\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C560BAQH7DplY56V6Yg/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1631305468682?e=1792022400&v=beta&t=YQYGN8QNPoHGiHQ60Or1H53BWHtgavE7P2I8ftVDRag\",\"sizes\":[{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C560BAQH7DplY56V6Yg/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1631305468682?e=1792022400&v=beta&t=YQYGN8QNPoHGiHQ6