o_url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4D16AQFzwd9OhzyLBw/profile-displaybackgroundimage-shrink_350_1400/profile-displaybackgroundimage-shrink_350_1400/0/1567177525469?e=1792022400&v=beta&t=1ixMMMAflp8iZQfPgktBBM7NYhdjPZkBRTr7ztHnCwo\",\"about\":\"Alexandre stands out as a lawyer specialized in matters related to Law and Information Technology, with experience over 30 years, with expertise in the areas of software, intellectual property of digital media, electronic crimes, civil liability of providers, court procedures electronically. He also works on contracts, E-Commerce, data protection, online reputation, domain names, election propaganda on the Internet, the audit of voting machines, and arbitration expertise in issues related to technology services and electronic evidence.\\n\\nHe stands out also as a legal forensic expert on Information Technology and intellectual property. \\n\\nHe worked for eight years (2002-2010) as chairman of Information Technology of the Brazilian Bar Association - OAB. He served as an evangelist for lawyers on topics related to technology and law, also helped to deploy the PKI Public Key Infrastructure for lawyers, known as AC-OAB. This project is the most significant Certification Authority related to legal professionals in the world, besides represented the entity in matters related to law and information technology in the State and Federal Courts, Government agencies in Brazil and abroad.\\n\\nHe was the coordinator of Pos-Graduate Courses in Law and Information Technology in the School of Law (ESA) of OAB-SP in São Paulo, since 2008, the pioneering academic project in this area of education in Brazil.\\n\\nHis law office coordinates in-company courses and lectures throughout the country and abroad on issues related to Law and Information Technology in Schools, Universities, Judiciary, Public and Private entities.\\n\\nHe is also a Forensic expert on IT Law and Intellectual Property issues.\\n\\nHis areas of practice are IT Law, Software, Contracts, E-Crimes, Legal Forensics, Intelectual Property, E-Commerce, Domain Names, Data Protection, in the workplace, Tailor-made courses on several topics related to Law and new Technologies for companies and teaching institutions.\",\"skills\":[\"Inteligência artificial\",\"Investigação de fraude\",\"Prevenção contra fraude\",\"Fraudes de cartão de crédito\",\"Fraude online\",\"Investigações de fraude corporativa\",\"Alegações de fraude\",\"Intellectual Property\",\"Cyberlaw\",\"Privacy Law\",\"Consumer Law\",\"Civil Litigation\",\"Copyright Law\",\"E-commerce\",\"Corporate Law\",\"Security\",\"ITIL\",\"International Law\",\"IT Management\",\"Information Security\"],\"experience\":[{\"position\":\"Membro da Comissão de Probática e Investigação Forense\",\"companyName\":\"OAB/MG\",\"companyLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/oab-mg/\",\"companyId\":\"1737846\",\"companyUniversalName\":\"oab-mg\",\"companyLogo\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E0BAQHBCkgmNtagKg/company-logo_400_400/B4EZqdFn51IQAc-/0/1763572095612/oab_mg_logo?e=1792022400&v=beta&t=lHSceM1Mns-AjIt-KUJVKN6MlsyXtviHRnrZc8PEy-k\",\"sizes\":[{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E0BAQHBCkgmNtagKg/company-logo_400_400/B4EZqdFn51IQAc-/0/1763572095612/oab_mg_logo?e=1792022400&v=beta&t=lHSceM1Mns-AjIt-KUJVKN6MlsyXtviHRnrZc8PEy-k\",\"width\":400,\"height\":400},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E0BAQHBCkgmNtagKg/company-logo_200_200/B4EZqdFn51IQAM-/0/1763572095612/oab_mg_logo?e=1792022400&v=beta&t=wZAo73g0m6eqt6hvas7mYUmTJKZLAfGx0djxlvDisfw\",\"width\":200,\"height\":200},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E0BAQHBCkgmNtagKg/company-logo_100_100/B4EZqdFn51IQAU-/0/1763572095612/oab_mg_logo?e=1792022400&v=beta&t=tFR72PTmvkPyYoz6N5uAtr40VIohaJVDla4-At_-Mbw\",\"width\":100,\"height\":100}]},\"location\":\"\",\"dateRange\":null,\"duration\":\"1 yr 9 mos\",\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"Jan\",\"year\":2025,\"text\":\"Jan 2025\"}