ansmitted by satellite to 51 locations in Brazil.\\n\\nThe themes of this research are:\\n\\n1 - Regulation of Internet in Brazil and the World and Domain Names\\nDomain Names\\n2. Technical Concepts of Information Technology\\n3. Privacy online, Electronic Monitoring\\n4. Propaganda on the Internet Election\\n5. Electronic Contracts\\n6. Liability of ISP\\n7. Procedural Practices electronically\\n8. Consumer Law\\n9. Cybercrime\\n10. Intellectual Property Law of Software Copyright ans Licenses\",\"skills\":[],\"employmentType\":\"\",\"workplaceType\":\"\"},{\"position\":\"Chairman IT Law Committee\",\"companyName\":\"OAB Conselho Federal\",\"companyLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/search/results/all/?keywords=OAB+Conselho+Federal\",\"companyId\":\"\",\"companyUniversalName\":\"\",\"companyLogo\":null,\"location\":\"\",\"dateRange\":null,\"duration\":\"11 yrs 2 mos\",\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"Jan\",\"year\":1999,\"text\":\"Jan 1999\"},\"endDate\":{\"month\":\"Feb\",\"year\":2010,\"text\":\"Feb 2010\"},\"description\":\"Na área institucional, estivemos presentes no cargo da Presidência da Comissão de Direito e Tecnologia da Informação no Conselho Federal da OAB ao longo de 8 anos (2002-2010), sendo o interlocutor da entidade sobre os temas de Direito Digital, participando ativamente nos debates legislativos sobre temas desta área no Congresso Nacional em audiências públicas, no Conselho Nacional de Justiça e em vários Tribunais Brasileiros.\",\"skills\":[],\"employmentType\":\"\",\"workplaceType\":\"\"}],\"education\":[{\"schoolName\":\"Harvard Law School\",\"description\":\"Curso de Especialização em Internet Law no Berkmqn Center\",\"insights\":\"Activities and societies: Internet Law\",\"skills\":null,\"schoolLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/1654/\",\"schoolId\":\"1654\",\"degree\":\"Specialization\",\"fieldOfStudy\":\"Internet Law at Berkman Center\",\"period\":\"2001 - 2001\",\"startDate\":{\"year\":2001,\"text\":\"2001\"},\"endDate\":{\