=1792022400&v=beta&t=-Mt9hX_Feo2bHuvp5wRZ9APTrmcg0e6P5cvm-lQKQCA\",\"width\":200,\"height\":200},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E0BAQEpbeJZThzBgA/company-logo_100_100/company-logo_100_100/0/1704404871256/harvard_law_school_logo?e=1792022400&v=beta&t=xFlGhB-A-YJp7no3qvU8JliAzKfezL1zUdpjtbJX69g\",\"width\":100,\"height\":100}]}}],\"languages\":[{\"name\":\"Espanhol\",\"proficiency\":\"Professional working proficiency\"},{\"name\":\"Francês\",\"proficiency\":\"Elementary proficiency\"}],\"projects\":[{\"title\":\"Information Resources Management for Process Efficiency in Power Industry (CEMIG).\",\"duration\":\"Jul 2013 - Present\",\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"Jul\",\"year\":2013,\"text\":\"Jul 2013\"},\"endDate\":{\"text\":\"Present\"},\"description\":null},{\"title\":\"Implantação e Gerenciamento do Cadastro Nacional de Advogados\",\"duration\":\"Jan 2001 - Present\",\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"Jan\",\"year\":2001,\"text\":\"Jan 2001\"},\"endDate\":{\"text\":\"Present\"},\"description\":\"Atuou em favor da implantação do Cadastro Nacional dos Advogados, a maior base de dados de profissionais de advocacia do mundo, contando atualmente com cerca de 1 milhão de associados. Agiu como representante do Conselho Federal para sincronizar dados atualizados diariamente entre as 27 Seccionais da OAB e o Conselho Federal da OAB em Brasilia\"}],\"connections_count\":15185,\"followers_count\":15830,\"open_to_work\":false,\"hiring\":false,\"premium\":true,\"verified\":true,\"phone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"website\":\"\",\"source\":\"harvestapi_full\",\"raw_profile\":{\"id\":\"ACoAAAB1kcAB-3xo3o04iT-GwZDUOqZ0tsoM134\",\"publicIdentifier\":\"atheniense\",\"linkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/atheniense\",\"firstName\":\"Alexandre\",\"lastName\":\"Atheniense\",\"emails\":[],\"headline\":\"Coordenador da Comissão de Direito Digital e Inteligencia Artificial do CESA - Centro de Estudos das Sociedades de Advogados\",\"websites\":[\"https://www.alexandreatheniense.com\"],\"openToWork\":false,\"hiring\":false,\"premium\":true,\"influencer\":false,\"memorialized\":false,\"creator\":true,\"location\":{\"linkedinText\":\"São Paulo, São Paulo, Brazil\",\"countryCode\":\"BR\",\"parsed\":{\"text\":\"São Paulo, Brazil\",\"countryCode\":\"BR\",\"regionCode\":null,\"country\":\"Brazil\",\"countryFull\":\"Brazil\",\"state\":\"São Paulo\",\"city\":\"São Paulo\"}},\"objectUrn\":\"7705024\",\"registeredAt\":\"2006-10-15T02:27:32.000Z\",\"topSkills\":[],\"connectionsCount\":15185,\"followerCount\":15830,\"verified\":true,\"about\":\"Alexandre stands out as a lawyer specialized in matters related to Law and Information Technology, with experience over 30 years, with expertise in the areas of software, intellectual property of digital media, electronic crimes, civil liability of providers, court procedures electronically. He also works on contracts, E-Commerce, data protection, online reputation, domain names, election propaganda on the Internet, the audit of voting machines, and arbitration expertise in issues related to technology services and electronic evidence.\\n\\nHe stands out also as a legal forensic expert on Information Technology and intellectual property. \\n\\nHe worked for eight years (2002-2010) as chairman of Information Technology of the Brazilian Bar Association - OAB. He served as an evangelist for lawyers on topics related to technology and law, also helped to deploy the PKI Public Key Infrastructure for lawyers, known as AC-OAB. This project is the most significant Certification Authority related to legal professionals in the world, besides represented the entity in matters related to law and information technology in the State and Federal Courts, Government agencies in Brazil and abroad.\\n\\nHe was the coordinator of Pos-Graduate Courses in Law and Information Technology in the School of Law (ESA) of OAB-SP in São Paulo, since 2008, the pioneering academic project in this area of education in Brazil.\\n\\nHis law office coordinates in-company courses and lectures throughout the country and abroad on issues related to Law and Information Technology in Schools, Universities, Judiciary, Public and Private entities.\\n\\nHe is also a Forensic expert on IT Law and Intellectual Property issues.\\n\\nHis areas of practice are IT Law, Software, Contracts, E-Crimes, Legal Forensics, Intelectual Property, E-Commerce, Domain Names, Data Protection, in the workplace, Tailor-made courses on several topics related to Law and new Technologies for companies and teaching institutions.\",\"currentPosition\":[{\"position\":\"Membro da Comissão de Probática e Investigação Forense\",\"location\":null,\"employmentType\":\"Contract\",\"workplaceType\":null,\"companyName\":\"OAB/MG\",\"companyUniversalName\":\"oab-mg\",\"companyLinkedinUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/oab-mg/\",\"companyId\":\"1737846\",\"duration\":\"1 yr 9 mos\",\"description\":null,\"skills\":null,\"startDate\":{\"month\":\"Jan\",\"year\":2025,\"text\":\"Jan 2025\"},\"endDate\":{\"text\":\"Present\"},\"companyLogo\":{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E0BAQHBCkgmNtagKg/company-logo_400_400/B4EZqdFn51IQAc-/0/1763572095612/oab_mg_logo?e=1792022400&v=beta&t=lHSceM1Mns-AjIt-KUJVKN6MlsyXtviHRnrZc8PEy-k\",\"sizes\":[{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E0BAQHBCkgmNtagKg/company-logo_400_400/B4EZqdFn51IQAc-/0/1763572095612/oab_mg_logo?e=1792022400&v=beta&t=lHSceM1Mns-AjIt-KUJVKN6MlsyXtviHRnrZc8PEy-k\",\"width\":400,\"height\":400},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E0BAQHBCkgmNtagKg/company-logo_200_200/B4EZqdFn51IQAM-/0/1763572095612/oab_mg_logo?e=1792022400&v=beta&t=wZAo73g0m6eqt6hvas7mYUmTJKZLAfGx0djxlvDisfw\",\"width\":200,\"height\":200},{\"url\":\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E0BAQHBCkgmNtagKg/company-logo_100_100/B4EZqdFn51IQAU-/0/1763572095612/oab_mg_logo?e=1792022400&v=beta&t=tFR72PTmvkPyYoz6N5uAtr40VIohaJVDla4-At_-Mbw\",\"width\":100,\"height\":100}]}}],\"profileTopEducati